<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">Tirhkohte</book>
  <para style="h">Tirhkohte</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tirhkohte</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tirhkohte</para>
  <para style="mt">Tirhkohte</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Theofil, ka lehkha hmasaah khân Isua rawngbâwl ṭan aṭanga vâna lâk chhoh a nih thlenga a thil tih leh a thu zirtîr zawng zawng chanchin ka ziak tawh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a tirhkoh thlante chu Thlarau Thianghlim hmangin thu a chah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thih hnuin a nung leh tih hriat nân hai rual lohvin vawi tam tak an hnênah a inentîr a, ni sawmli chhûng Pathian ram thu sawiin a inlâr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An zînga a awm laiin, “Jerusalem khua chhuahsan suh u, Pa thutiam ka hrilh che u kha lo nghâk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Johana chuan tuiin a baptis a, nangni erawh chu ni rei lo tê-ah Thlarau Thianghlima baptis in ni ang,” tiin a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An lo kal khâwm chuan, “Lalpa, tûnah em ni Israel-te ram i tundinsak leh dâwn?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Pain a hun leh ni, ama thu thu-a awm tûra a dah chu nangni lo hriat chi a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela, Thlarau Thianghlim in chunga a lo thlen hunah thiltihtheihna in la nei ang a; tichuan, Jerusalem-ah te, Judai leh Samari ram pumah te, kâwlkil thlengin ka thuhretute in ni tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chûng thu chu a sawi zawh chuan, an en reng laiin vâna hruai chhoh a ni a, chhûmin an hmuh phâk lohvah a la bo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutia vâna a chho an thlîr reng lai chuan mi pahnih puan vâr sin an kiangah an lo ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Galili mite u, engati nge vân lam ena in din reng le? He Isua in hnên ata vâna lâk chhoh hi, vâna a chho in hmuh ang tak hian a lo kal leh dâwn a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, Oliv tlâng an tih aṭang chuan Jerusalem-ah an kîr leh ta a; chu tlâng chu Jerusalem aṭanga sabat ni kal tâwk vêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khua an luh chuan an thlenna pindan chungnungah an chho va; chûngte chu Petera te, Johana te, Jakoba te, Andria te, Filipa te, Thoma te, Bartholomaia te, Mathaia te, Alfaia fapa Jakoba te, zealot pâwla mi Simona te leh Jakoba fapa Juda te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An za chuan hmeichhiate leh Isua nu Mari leh Isua unaute nên lungrual takin an ṭawngṭai ho ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni khat chu, unaute awm khâwmnaah chuan Petera a ding a, an vai chuan za leh sawmhnih vêl an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Unaute u, Thlarau Thianghlimin Isua mantute hruaitu Juda thu Davida kâa a lo sawi lâwk, Lehkha Thu kha a lo thleng tûr rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chu kan zîngah a tel ve ṭhîn a, kan rawngbâwlpui a ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chuan thil sual tiha a pawisa hlawhin hmun pakhat a lei a, a tla hlum a, a rîl chhuak vek khawpin a pum a ṭet a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chu thu chu Jerusalem-a awm zawng zawngin an hria a, chu hmun chu anmahni ṭawngin, ‘Akeldama,’ an ti a, chu chu ‘Thisen hmun,’ tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Fakna hla bu-ah hetiang hian ziak a ni: ‘A in leh lo chu ram sela, A chhûngah tu mah chêng suh se,’ tih leh, ‘A hotu nihna chu mi dangin chang rawh se,’ tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, kan Lalpa Isua hova kan chêttlat laia kan zînga tel ve ṭhîn,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Baptistu Johana hun aṭanga vâna min chhohsan ni thlenga tel ṭhîn mi pakhat, a thawhlehna min hriatpuitu atân kan thlang chhuak tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, mi pahnih, Josefa, Barsaba an vuah, Justa an tih bawk leh Mathia an ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Nang, Lalpa, mi zawng zawng rilru hretu, ama hmuna awm tûra a tirhkoh nihna leh a rawngbâwl hna tlâwmsantu Juda hmun luah tûrin he mite pahnihah hian a tu zâwk nge i thlan min hriattîr ang che,” tiin an ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An pahniha chungah chuan ai an en a, an ai en chu Mathia chungah a tla a, Mathia chu tirhkoh Sâwmpakhatte zîngah chuan chhiar tel a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pentikos ni a lo thlen chuan an za-in an awm khâwmna inah chuan an inkhâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thâwklehkhatah vân ata thlipui thâwm ang ri a lo thleng ta phut a, an ṭhutna inah chuan a ri ta hum hum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Meialh, lei ang tak insem darh an hmu a, an chungah a fu ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An za-in Thlarau Thianghlimin an khat ta vek a, Thlarauvin a ṭawngtîr angin ṭawng dangtein an ṭawng ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vân hnuaia hnam hrang hrang zînga chêng, Pathian ngaihsak Juda-te chu Jerusalemah an châm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu thâwm chu hriain mi tam tak an lo kal khâwm a, an thu sawi chu mi tinin mahni ṭawng ang ṭheuhvin an hre thei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mak an ti êm êm a, “En teh u, hêng thu sawitu zawng zawng hi Galili mi an ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Engtin nge kan zaa mahni ṭawng ang maia an thu sawi kan hriat theih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat Parthai mi te, Medai mi te, Elamitai mite kan ni a; ṭhenkhat Mesapotamia rama awm te, Judai rama awm te, Kapadokia ram te, Ponto leh Asia ram te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Frugia leh Pamfulia ram te, Aigupta leh Libua rama Kurini khaw chhehvêla awm te kan ni a; ṭhenkhat Rom khua aṭanga lo kal,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Juda-te leh Juda saphun te kan ni a; ṭhenkhat Kret thliarkâra mi leh Arab rama mi kan ni si a; nimahsela, Pathian thiltih ropuite an sawi mahni ṭawng ang ṭheuhva kan hriat hi!” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An vaiin a ngaihna hre lovin mak an ti a, “Hei hi eng nge ni ta ngai!” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat erawh chuan an nuihsan a, “Eng uain emaw an rui a nih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Petera chu Sâwmpakhatte nên an ding za a, mipui hnênah chuan ring takin thu a sawi a, “Nangni Juda unaute leh Jerusalem-a awm zawng zawngte u, ka thu hi ngun takin ngaithla teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hêngho hi in ngaih angin an rui lo ve, zîng dâr kua chauh a la nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />He thil hi zâwlnei Joela sawi kha a ni zâwk:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathianin, ‘Ni hnuhnûngahte chuan hei hi ka ti dâwn a ni: Mi zawng zawng chungah ka Thlarau ka leih ang a, In fanu in fapaten ka thu an hril ang In tlangvâlten inlârnate an hmu ang a, In upaten mumangahte an mang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chûng ni-ah te chuan ka rawngbâwltute a hmei a pain, an chungah Ka thlarau ka leih ang a, ka thu an hril ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chung lam vânah thil mak te, Hnuai lam leiah chhinchhiahna te ka hmuhtîr ang, Thisen te, mei te, meikhu ngun ngun te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ni tihthim a ni ang a, thla thisen angin a sen khuih bawk ang, Lalpa ni ropui leh pawimawh tak a lo thlen hmain.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa hming lam apiang chu chhandam an ni ang,’ a ti, a tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Nangni Israel mite u, ngaithla teh u; in hriat ṭheuh angin Pathianin Nazaret Isua hmangin thil ropui tak tak te, thil mak te leh chhinchhiahna te in zîngah ngei tiin a mi ruat a nihzia chiang takin a tihlan kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani chu Pathian tum lâwk leh rêl lâwk angin in hnênah pêk a ni a. Nangnin hnam dang mite hmangin krawsah in khêngbet a, in tihlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Nimahsela, ani chu thihna chelh hlen rual a nih loh avângin Pathian chuan thihna phuarnate chu a phelh a, a kaitho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Davida pawhin a chungchâng hetianga a lo sawi kha: ‘Ka hmaah Lalpa ka hmu fo va, ka bulah a awm a, eng mahin mi tinghîng thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka thinlung a hlim a, ka lei pawh a lâwm a, ka tisa pawh hian a beisei tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka thlarau mitthi khuaah i hnutchhiah lo va, I mi thianghlim ruang a ṭawih i phal hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangin nunna kawng mi kawhhmuh a, I hmêl hmuin lâwmin ka khat ang,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Unaute u, thlahtu Davida thu chu huai takin ka hrilh a che u, ani chu a thi tawh a, an phûm a, a thlân pawh kan bul lawkah a la awm reng alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ani chu zâwlnei a ni a, a thlahte zînga tu emaw a lalṭhutthlêng luah tûrin Pathianin a hnênah a tiam tlat tih a hria a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />‘mitthi khuaa hnutchhiah ni lovin, a ruang pawh a ṭawih loh tûr thu’ a sawi hi, Krista thawhleh tûr thu a sawi a lo ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A ni, chu Isua chu Pathianin a kaitho leh ta a, chu thu hretute chu kan za hian kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pathian ding lamah chawimawi a ni ta a, Pa hnên ata Thlarau Thianghlim tiam chu a dawng a, in hmuh leh in hriat hi a thilpêk a rawn leih chu a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Davida chu vânah a lâwn chho lo ve; amah ngeiin, ‘Lalpa chuan ka Lalpa hnênah, ka ding lamah lo ṭhu rawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />I hmêlmate i ke nghahchhanah Ka han dah ang e,’ a ti e, a ti zâwk a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Chutichuan, Isua in khenbeh kha, Pathianin Lalpaah leh Kristaah a siam ta ngei tih Israel mi tinin hre ngei rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An thu hriat chuan an thinlung a khawih a, Petera leh tirhkoh dangte hnênah chuan, “Unaute u, eng nge kan tih tâk ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Petera chuan, “Sim ula, in sualte ngaihdam nân Isua Krista hmingin baptisma chang ṭheuh rawh u; tichuan, he thil pêk, thlarau Thianghlim hi in dawng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A tiam hi in tân a ni a, in fate tân pawh a ni a, ram hla taka mi zawng zawng tân leh, Lalpa kan Pathianin a koh apiangte tân a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Thu dang tam tak sawiin a sâwm a, “Tûnlai mi sual takte lakah hian intihim rawh u,” tiin a fuih nghâl bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A thu zâwm apiangin baptisma an chang a; chumi ni chuan mi sângthum laiin an belh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tirhkohte thu zirtîr ngaithlaa inpâwl khâwmin, chhang phel leh ṭawngṭaiin an awm ho ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Mi tinin an zah ta hle a, tirhkohte chuan thil mak leh chhinchhiahna tam tak an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ringtu zawng zawngte chu an awm khâwmna inah an awm ho ṭhîn a, engkim an inṭâwm vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A neite chuan an in leh lo te leh an thil neih te an hralh a, an châkkhai daih tâwk ṭheuhvin an zaa hnênah chuan an sem ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ni tin Tempulah lungrual takin an inkhâwm ṭhîn a, in hrang hrangahte chhang an phel a, hlim tak leh inphal takin chaw an ei ho ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Pathian an fak a, mi zawng zawng duhsak an hlawh a, Lalpa chuan a chhandam apiangte chu ni tin an zîngah a tel belhtîr zêl a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chawhnu dâr thum, ṭawngṭai hun pangngaiah chuan Petera leh Johana chu Tempulah an chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pa pakhat, a pian tirh ata kebai hi an rawn zâwn a. Tempula kalte hnêna kut lo dawh tûrin kawngkhâr, ‘Mawi,’ an tih bulah ni tin an dah ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu mi chuan Petera leh Johana Tempula lût tûr chu a hmu a, kut a lo dawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anni chuan an en reng a, Petera chuan a hnênah, “Min han en teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ani chuan eng emaw dawn beiseiin a han en a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Petera chuan, “Tangka leh rangkachak eng mah ka nei lo; nimahsela, ka neih chhun ka pe ang che, Nazaret Isua Krista hmingin kein kal tawh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kut ding lam a vuan a, a kai tho va, a ke leh a kheimit te chu a lo chak ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chu a zuang tho va, a ding a, kein a kal ta a. Kea kala zuangin Pathian fak chung zêlin Tempulah chuan an rualin a lût ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mipui zawng zawngin kea a kal leh Pathian a fak an hmuh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tempul kawngkhâr, Mawi bula kutdawh ṭhu ṭhîn kha a ni tih an hria a, a chunga thil thleng chu mak an ti êm êm a, a ngaihna an hre lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan Petera leh Johana a la vawn reng laiin mipui chu Solomona hulhliap an tihah chuan an lo tlân khâwm a, mak an ti êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Peteran chu chu a hmuhin mipui hnênah chuan, “Nangni Israel mite u, engati nge hei hi mak in tih? He mi hi keimahni theihna emaw, kan ṭhat bîk vâng emawa kan kaltîr ang êm chuan engati nge min en reng?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abrahama Pathian, Isaka Pathian, Jakoba Pathian, min thlahtute Pathian chuan a chhiahhlawh Isua a chawimawi ta a nih hi. Ani chu in mantîr a, rorêltu Pilatan chhuah a tum pawhin in hnial tlat a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi thianghlim leh fel tak kha in duh lo va, tual that kha chhuahsak che u in ngên ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nunna petu chu in thahtîr a; nimahsela, Pathianin ani chu mitthi zîng ata a kaitho leh ta a, chumi thuhretute chu kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Isua hminga thiltihtheihna leh chu hming rinna chuan in hmuh leh in hriat ṭhina hi a tidam ta a; amah rinna avâng chuan he mi hi in zaa in hmuh ang hian a dam ta viah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tûnah hian unaute u, nangni leh in hotute pawhin in thiltih kha in hre tak tak lo a ni tih ka hria e. Krista chuan a tuar tûr a ni tih
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathianin a zâwlnei zawng zawng hmanga a lo sawi lâwk kha hetiang hi a thlentîr dân a lo ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, in sualte sim ula, hawi kîr leh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa hnên ata harhtharna hun a lo thleng ang a, in tâna a ruat Mesia, Isua chu, a rawn tîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, engkim siam thar hun a thlen hma chuan vânah ani chu a awm rih tûr a ni; siamtharna thu chu Pathianin a zâwlnei thianghlimte kâa hmasâng ata a sawi daih tawh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mosia pawh khân, ‘Lalpa in Pathianin keimah ang hi in unaute zînga mi, zâwlnei pakhat a dinsak ang che u; eng pawh in hnêna a sawi apiang in zâwm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chu zâwlnei thu ngaithla lo apiang chu Pathian mite zîng ata tihboral zêl tûr a ni,’ a tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Samuela leh a hnua zâwlnei zawng zawngte khân tûnlai chanchin hi a ni an lo hrilh lâwk ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Zâwlneite thu leh in thlahtute hnêna thuthlung rochungtute in ni asin. Abrahama hnênah chuan, ‘I thlahah chuan khawvêla hnam tinin malsâwmna an dawng ang,’ a tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pathianin a chhiahhlawh chu a thlang a, in sualte hawisantîr ṭheuh tûr che u leh malsâwm tûr che uin in hnênah a rawn tîr hmasa a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Petera leh Johanan mipuite hnêna thu an sawi lai chuan, puithiam chu Tempul pulis hotupa nên, Sadukai-hote nên an hnênah an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Isua thawhlehna thu sawiin mitthi thawhlehna thu mipui an zirtîr avâng chuan an lungni lo êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, an man a, tlai lam a nih avângin a tûk thlengin tân inah an khung ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, an thu ngaithlatute zînga tam tak chuan an ring ve ta a, an za chuan sângnga lai an tling a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Juda hotu te, upa te, Dân zirtîrtu te Jerusalemah an inkhâwm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />chûng chu Puithiam lalber Ana te, Kaiafa te, Johana te, Aleksandara te, puithiam lal thlahho te nên an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Petera leh Johana chu a laiah an dintîr a; “Engtia tidam thei nge in niha, tu hmingin nge he thil hi in tih?” tiin an chhâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Petera chu Thlarau Thianghlimin a khat a, an hnênah, “Mipui hotute leh upate u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />vawiinah hian kebai tihdam thu-ah engtia dam nge a nih min zâwt a ni bawk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />nangni zawng zawng leh Israel mi zawng zawngin hre teh u; Nazaret Isua Krista, in khenbeh, Pathianin mitthi zîng ata a kaihthawh leh tâka hming khân he mi hi tihdam a ni a; tûnah hetah in hmaah dam varin a ding ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani hi alâwm, nangni in satuten in duh loh lung kha, a kil lung pawimawh ber a lo ni ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu dang hnênah mah chhandamna a awm lo, vân hnuaia mihring hming sak zîngah min chhandam thei hming dang rêng rêng a awm lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Petera leh Johana huaizia chu an hmuhin, lehkha thiam lo leh mi mâwl mai an nih an hriatin, mak an ti hle a; Isua hnêna awm ṭhîn an ni tih an hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, an mi tihdam, an kianga ding chu an enin eng mah sawisêl tûr a awm si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Sanhedrin ata an chhuahtîr hnu chuan an inrâwn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Hêng mite hi engtin nge kan tih tâk ang? An thil mak tih hi Jerusalem-a awm zawng zawngin an hriat tâk hi; keini pawhin kan hnial thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, miin an hriat darh lehzual loh nân tu hnênah mah he hminga thu sawi leh tawh lo tûrin i vau ang u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, anni chu an ko leh a, Isua hminga thu sawi lo tûr leh zirtîr tawh tawp lo tûrin thu an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, Petera leh Johana chuan an hnênah, “Pathian mit hmuhah Pathian thu zawm aiin mihring thu zawm chu a dik zâwk dâwn emaw chu, ngaihtuah teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keini zawng thil kan hmuh leh kan hriat hi sawi lovin kan awm thei lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan nasa takin an vau va, an chhuah ta a. An thiltih avânga mi zawng zawngin Pathian an chawimawi ṭheuh si avângin hremna remchâng an hmu lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mak taka an tihdam chu kum sawmli aia upa zâwk mah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Petera te chu an chhuak a, an ṭhiante hnênah an va kal a, puithiam lalte leh upaten an hnêna an sawi chu an hrilh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An thu ngaithlatute chuan a rualin ring takin Pathian an au va, “Aw Lalber, nang, vân te, lei te, tuifinriat te leh a chhûnga thil awm zawng zawng siamtu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thlarau Thianghlimin min thlahtu i chhiahhlawh Davida kâin hêng thu hi i sawi a: ‘Jentail-te engati nge an thinur? Mipuiin engati nge thil sâwt lo an rêl?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lei lalten an er a, hotute pawh a chungah an inrâwn khâwm a, Lalpa leh a hriak thiha chungah chuan,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Chutiang tak chuan he khuaah hian i chhiahhlawh thianghlim Isua, i hriak thiha chungah chuan, Heroda leh Pontia Pilata te chu Jentail-te leh Juda-te nên an inthurual ta ngei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangin i ruat lâwk ang thlentîr i tum chu tihlawhtling tûrin an pung khâwm a lo ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lalpa, ngai teh, tûna an mi vau dân hi, i thu hril ngam tûrin i bawihte hi huaisenna pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mite tidam tûrin i kut phar la, i chhiahhlawh thianghlim Isua hmingin chhinchhiahna te leh thil makte tihtîr bawk ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutia an ṭawngṭai zawh chuan an awmkhâwmna hmun chu a lo nghîng a, an za-in Thlarau Thianghlimin an khat a, huai takin Pathian thu an hril ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ringtuho chu thinlung hmun khat leh rilru hmun khat puin an awm a, an zînga tu mahin an thil neihte chu, ‘ka ta bîk a ni,’ an ti lo, engkim an inṭâwm zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tirhkohte chuan thiltihtheihna nasa tak neiin Lalpa Isua thawhlehna thu an hril ṭhîn a, an za-in Pathian duhsak an hlawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />An zînga tu mah tlachham an awm lo. In emaw, ram emaw nei apiangin an hralh a, a man chu an rawn keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tirhkohte hnênah an hlân a, an châkkhai daih ṭheuhvin an insem ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Josefa, tirhkohten Barnaba an tih (chu chu ‘Thlamuanna fa,’ tihna a ni), Levia chi, Kupra thliarkâra mi pawh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />ram a nei a, a hralh a, a man chu rawn kengin tirhkohte hnênah a hlân a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi dang pakhat, a hming Anania a awm a, a nupui chu Sapfiri a ni. Ram a hralh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a man chu a nupui hriatpuiin anmahni tân an dah hrang a, a ṭhen chauh rawn kengin tirhkohte hnênah a rawn hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, Peteran, “Anani, Thlarau Thianghlim bum tûr leh ram man a ṭhen zêp tûrin engati nge Setanan i thinlung a luah le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I hralh hma zawng khân i ta a ni a, i hralh hnu pawhin a man chu i thu thu-a i tih tûr a ni lâwm ni? Engati nge hetiang thil ti tûra rilru i put le? Mihring i bum a ni lo va, Pathian i bum a ni zâwk e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ananian chûng thu chu a hriat chuan a tlu a, a thi ta a. A hria apiangin an hlau ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tlangvâlho an lo thawk a, an tuam a, an zâwn chhuak a, an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dârkâr thum lai hnuah chuan a nupui chu thil awmzia hre lovin a lo lût ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Petera chuan a hnênah, “Mi hrilh teh, ram chu heti zât chiah hian maw in hralh?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Ni e, heti zât chiah hian,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Petera chuan, “Engati nge Lalpa Thlarau fiah tuma in inthurual ni? Ngai rawh, i pasal phûmtute pawh kawngka bul an lo thlen leh tawh saw; nang pawh an zâwn chhuak ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, thâwklehkhatah a ke bulah chuan a tlu a, a thi ve ta mai a. Tlangvâlte chu an lo lût a, ani chu thi-in an rawn hmu a, an zâwn chhuak a, a pasal kiangah an phûm ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kohhran mi zawng zawngte leh chûng thu hria apiangte chuan an hlau ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tirhkohte chuan mipui zîngah chhinchhiahna leh thil mak tam tak an ti zêl a. Anniho chu an za-in lungrual takin Solomona hulhliapah an inkhâwm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An zîngah chuan tu mah mi dang an tel ve ngam lo nâ a, mite chuan an ngaisâng êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa ringtute erawh chu, a hmei a pa, an zînga tel an pung tial tial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, dam lote pawh kawtthlêrahte an zâwn chhuak a, khumah te, mutphahah te an muttîr a. Petera hlim chuan a kal vêl pahin an zînga ṭhenkhat tal a hliah theih nân an ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jerusalem kiang vêl aṭang pawhin mi an lo kal a, damlo te, ramhuai bawlhhlawh man te an rawn hruai a, chûngho zawng zawng pawh chu an lo dam ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Puithiam lalber leh a hote zawng zawng, Sadukai pâwla mite chu an lo thawk a; tirhkohte chu an îtsîk êm êm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />an man a, vântlâng tân inah an khung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, zânah Lalpa tirh Vântirhkoh pakhatin tân in kawngkhâr chu a rawn hawng a, a hruai chhuak a; an hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Kal ta ula, Tempulah va ding ula, mipuite hnênah hêng nunna thu leh a awmzia zawng zawng hi va sawi tawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chu thu chu an hriatin an kal a, zîngah chuan Tempulah an lût a, mi an zirtîr ta a. Puithiam lalber leh a hote chuan Israel upate, Sanhedrin mi zawng zawng an khâwm a, tirhkohte chu va hruai tûrin tân inah mi an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An tirhte chu an va kal a; mahse, tân inah chuan anni chu an hmu si lo. An lo kîr leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tân in chu him taka inkhârin, a vêngtute pawh kawngkhâr bula dingin kan hmu a; nimahsela, kan han hawng a, a chhûngah tu mah kan hmu si lo,” tiin an rawn sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tempul pulis hotu leh puithiam lalten an hriat chuan, “Engtizia nge ni ta le?” tiin an buai hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan mi pakhat a lo kal a, an hnênah, “Ngai teh u, tân ina mi in khungte khân Tempulah sâwn mi an zirtîr ka ti,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, Tempul pulis hotu chu a hote nên an va kal a, tirhkohte chu tilui lovin an rawn hruai a, an man luih mai chuan mipuiin lungin an dêng ang tih an hlau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An rawn hruai thlen chuan Sanhedrin hmaah chuan an dintîr a. Puithiam lalber chuan an hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“He hming hian zirtîr tawh hauh lo tûrin thu kan pe che u a; ngai teh u, in thu zirtîrin Jerusalem in tihkhah vek tawh hi; chu pa thisen mawh chu kan chunga bel in tum a nih hi le!” tiin a chhâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Petera leh tirhkohte erawh chuan, “Mihring thu aiin Pathian thu kan zâwm zâwk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Min thlahtute Pathian chuan, thinga khai kânga in tihhlum tâk Isua kha a kaitho leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel-te sual simtîra ngaihdam an nih theih nân Amah ngei kha Pathianin Lal leh Chhandamtu atân a ding lamah a chawimawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A thu zâwmtute hnêna Pathian pêk Thlarau Thianghlim leh keini hi chûng thuhretutechu kan ni,” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chûng an thu hriat chuan an thin a khei ta riau va, tirhkohte chu tihhlum an tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nimahsela, Farisai pakhat, a hming Gamaliela, Dân zirtîrtu, mi zawng zawng ngaihsân tak chu Sanhedrin-ah chuan a ding a, tirhkohte chu chhuahtîr rih tûrin vêngtute chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Rorêltute hnênah chuan, “Israel mite u, he mite chunga in thil tih tumah hian fîmkhur rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hmân deuh tawhah khân Theuda chu mi ropui tak nia inchhâlin a lo kal a, mi zali vêl laiin an zui a. Ani chu an that a, amah zuitute zawng zawng chu an darh vek a, eng mah an ni ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan, chhiarpui lai khân, Galili rama mi Juda kha a lo kal leh a, ani pawhin mipui a hîp leh hle a. Nimahsela, ani pawh an that a, amah zuitu zawng zawng pawh an darh leh ta vek bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chuvângin, tûnah hian ka ti a che u, he mite hi khawih suh ula, awmtîr mai mai rawh u. Hêng an thiltih tum leh an thiltihte hi mihring tihchhuah mai a nih chuan a tâwp leh mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Pathian tihchhuah a nih erawh chuan in tiboral thei lo vang; Pathian dodâl in lo ni hlauh dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tichuan, a thu chu an zâwm a, tirhkohte chu an ko va, an vua a, Isua hminga thu sawi tawh hauh lo tûrin thu an pe a, an chhuah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Chutichuan, chu Hming avânga mualpho tuar tlâka ruat an nih avângin, lâwm êm êm chungin Sanhedrin ata chu an chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ni tin, Tempulah leh in lamah Isua kha Mesia chu a nih thu hril leh zirtîr an bâng chuang lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng laia zirtîrte an pun zêl lai chuan an ni tin thil semah an hmeithaite an ngaihthah bîk tiin Grik ṭawng hmang Juda-te chu Hebrai-hote chungah an phunnawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sâwmpahnihte chuan zirtîrhote chu an ko khâwm vek a, “Pathian thu hril thlahthlama ni tin khawsakna lam kan buaipui hi a dik lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, unaute u, in zînga mi hming ṭha, Thlarau Thianghlima khat, mi pasarih thlang ula, an hnênah hêng hna hi kan hlân ang e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />keini erawh chu ṭawngṭai leh thu rawngbâwlah kan inpumpêk tlat ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chu thu chuan mipui zawng zawng chu a tilâwm a; tichuan, Stefana, ringtu nghet tak leh Thlarau Thianghlima khat leh Filipa te, Prokora te, Nikanora te, Timona te, Parmena te, Nikola, Juda saphun, Antiokei khuaa mite an thlang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng mite chu tirhkohte hmaah an dintîr a, tirhkohte chuan an lu chunga kut nghatin an ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathian thu chu a darh zêl a, Jerusalem-ah chuan zirtîr an pung nasa êm êm a, puithiamte zînga mi tam tak pawhin Rinna chu an pawm ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Stefana chu Pathian khawngaihna leh thiltihtheihnain a khat a, mi zîngah thil mak leh chhinchhiahna ropui tak tak a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, Kurini khua leh Aleksandria khua ata Juda ṭhenkhat ‘Sal chhuak pâwl’ Sunagog an tiha tel ve ṭhînte leh Kilikia ram leh Asia rama Juda-te an lo thawk a, Stefana chu an rawn hnial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A finna leh a sawipuitu Thlarau chu an hnial hneh si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, “Mosia leh Pathian pawi a sawi kan hria,” ti tûrin mite an tham a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipuite leh upate leh Dân zirtîrtute chu an fuihpawrh a, Stefana chu an bei a, an man a, Sanhedrin hmaah an hruai ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hretu der an rawn thawhpui a, chûng chuan, “He mi hian kan Tempul thianghlim leh kan Dân hi a sawichhiat a bâng duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />‘Nazaret Isuan kan Tempul hi a ṭhiat ang a, Mosia Dân min pêkte hi a tidanglam vek dâwn,’ a tih kan hria a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rorêltute zawng zawng chuan Stefana chu an en ṭhuap a, a hmêl chu vântirhkoh hmêl angin an hmu a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Puithiam lalber chuan, “Hêng thu hi a dik em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ka unaute leh ka pute u, ngaithla rawh u. Kan pu Abrahama chu Haran khuaa a awm hma, Mesapotamia rama a awm lai khân, ropuina Pathian chu a hnênah a inlâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I ram leh i laichînte hi chhuahsan la, ram ka la kawhhmuh tûr che lamah kal rawh,’ a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Kaldai ram ata a chhuak a, Haran-ah awmhmun a khuar a. Chuta ṭang chuan a pa thih hnuah tûna in awmna ramah hian Pathianin a pêm luhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian chuan ram luah tûr hniak khat pawh a pe lo va; mahse, Abrahama chu fa nei lo a ni chungin, amah leh a thlahte hnênah he ram hi pêk a tiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathianin hetiang hian a hrilh a ni, ‘I thlahte chu mi ramah an la mikhual ang a, kum zali lai mi bawihah awmin tihduhdah an ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawiha siamtu tûr hnam chu keimah ngeiin ka la ngaihtuah ang a, chumi hnuah an chhuak ang a, he hmunah hian ka rawng an la bâwl ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathianin a hnênah serh tan thu kha a thlung a. Chutiang tak chuan fapa Isaka a neih khân, a ni riat ni-ah a serh a tansak a. Isaka chuan fapa Jakoba a nei a, Jakoban fapa sâwm leh pahnih, thlahtute kha, a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tin, thlahtute khân Josefa chu an îtsîk a, Aigupta ram lamah an hralh a; nimahsela, Pathian a hnênah a awm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hrehawm a tuar zawng zawng ata chu a chhan chhuak zêl a. Aigupta rama lal Farawa mit hmuha mi fing tak leh duhawm tak a nihtîr a; Farawa chuan Aigupta ram chungah leh a chhûngkaw chunga hotu-ah a siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta leh Kanan ram pumah ṭâm a lo tla a, an tuar na hle a; kan pute chuan ei tûr an nei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jakoban Aigupta ramah buh a awm tih a hriat chuan, kan pute chu a tîr chhuak a, chu chu an kal hmasak ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An kal vawi hnihnaah Josefa chu a unaute hnênah a inhriattîr a, Farawa pawhin Josefa chhûngte chu a hre ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Josefa chuan a pa Jakoba leh a unaute zawng zawng a kohtîr a, an vaiin sawmsarih leh panga lai an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jakoba te chu Aigupta ramah an chhuk a, ani leh kan pute chu an thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An ruang chu Sekem khaw thlengin an rawn zâwn a, Abrahaman Sekem khuaa Hamora fate laka tangka suma a lei thlânah an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abrahama hnêna Pathian thutiam kha a thlen dâwn lai chuan kan mite chu Aigupta-ah chuan an pung chak hle a, an tam ta êm êm mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aigupta ramah chuan lal dang, Josefa hre lo a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chu mi chuan kan chite chu vervêk takin a bei a, kan pute chu a tiduhdah a, an fa sênte thi tûrin a paihtîr zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Mosia a lo piang a, nausên duhawm bîk tak mai a ni a, anmahni inah thla thum an awmpui a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />an in ata an dah chhuah hnu chuan Farawa fanuin a chhar a, ama fa atân a nei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mosia chu Aigupta ram finna zawng zawng a zirtîr a; tichuan, thu sawi thei tak leh thil ti thei tak a lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mosia chuan kum sawmli a nih kum khân, a unau Israel fate chu tlawh ṭûlin a hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A va tlawh chuan an zînga pakhat chu Aigupta miin a lo tiduhdah lai a hmu a, a chhan a, a phuba a lâksak a, a tiduhdahtu chu a that ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mosia chuan ama kutin Pathianin anmahni a chhanhim dâwn tih a unauten an hria emaw a ti a; nimahsela, an lo hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“A tûkah chuan mi pahnih insual lai a rawn hmu a, ṭhelh tumin, ‘Pute u, unau in ni alâwm, engati nge in insual tâk mai?’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A ṭhenawm bei hmasatu zâwk chuan Mosia chu a nam kiang a, ‘Kan chunga hotu-ah leh rorêltuah tuin nge siam che?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nimina Aigupta mi i thah ang khân mi thah ve i tum a ni maw?’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chu thu avâng chuan Mosia chu a tlân bo va. Midian ramah a va châm ta reng a, chutah chuan fapa pahnih a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Tin, kum sawmli a vei hnuin Sinai thlalêrah hnimbuka meialh zîngah Vântirhkoh a hnênah a inlâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mosian a thil hmuh chu mak a ti êm êm a; fiah tumin a va hnaih a, Lalpa awin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />‘Kei hi i pute Pathian, Abrahama te, Isaka te, Jakoba te Pathian chu ka nih hi,’ a rawn ti a. Tichuan, Mosia chu a khûr a, a fiah ngam ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a hnênah, ‘I pheikhawk kha phelh rawh, i dinna kha hmun thianghlim a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Aigupta rama ka mite an tihretheihzia ka hmu reng a, an rûm pawh ka hre reng a, anmahni hruai chhuak tûrin ka lo chhuk ta a ni. Hawh teh, Aigupta ramah ka tîr ang che,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Chu Mosia, ‘hotu-ah leh rorêltuah tuin nge siam che,’ tia an hnara ngei chu, Pathianin hotu leh chhanchhuaktu atân hnimbuka a hnêna inlâr vântirhkoh hmangin a rawn tîr ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ani chuan anni chu a hruai chhuak a, Aigupta ramah te, Tuipui Senah te, thlalêrah te kum sawmli chhûng lai thil mak leh chhinchhiahnate tiin a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chu Mosia chu Israel fate hnêna, ‘Pathianin keimah ang in unaute zînga mi zâwlnei a la siamsak ang che u,’ titu kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Amah chuan thlalêra pung khâwm zîngah Sinai tlânga amah betu vântirhkoh chu a lo chhâwn a, kan pute hnêna thu sawi ṭhîna, min pêk chhâwn tûr thu nungte pawh dawngtu a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kan pute chuan a thu an zâwm duh lo va, an hnâwl a, Aigupta lama kîr leh an duh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Arona hnênah, ‘Kan hma hruaitu atân pathiante min siamsak teh khai; he Mosia, Aigupta ram ata min hruai chhuaktu lah hi engtin nge a awm tâk pawh kan hre si lo,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Chutichuan, bâwngno lim an siam a, chu milim hnênah chuan inthawina an hlân a, anmahni kutchhuak chu an hlimpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Tichuan, Pathianin anmahni a hawisan a, vâna arsite an biak theihna tûrin a kalsan a, zâwlnei Lehkhabua: ‘Israel chhûngte u, kum sawmli chhûngin thlalêrah khân inthawina ran mi hlân em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Moleka puan in in zâwn a, In Pathian Refana arsi lemte in siam a. Chûng lemte chu chibai in bûk a, chuvângin, Babulon piah lamah ka tântîr ang che u,’ tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Kan pute chuan thlalêrah khân Pathian chênna puan in an nei a, Mosia hnêna Pathianin siam dân tûr a hrilh laia a lem a entîr ang taka siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Chu ngei chu kan puten an chhawm zêl a, Pathianin kan pute hmaa Jentail-te a hnawh chhuaha, Josua hova Kanan ram an luh khân an luhpui a, Davida hun thleng khân a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Davida chuan Pathian duhsakna a dawng a, Jakoba Pathian tân in sak phalna a dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Nimahsela, Solomona zâwkin in chu a saksak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Chungnungbera zawng kuta sak inahte a awm ngai lo, zâwlneiin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Lalpan, ‘Vân ka ṭhutthlêng a ni a, lei ka ke nghahchhan a ni. In eng ang nge mi saksak anga, ka chawlhhmun pawh khawiah nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hêng thil zawng zawng hi ka kuta ka siam a ni lo vem ni?’ tia a sawi ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />“Mi tihmawh, serh tan lohho ang mai, thinlung sak leh beng tululte u; Thlarau Thianghlim in dodâl fo va, in pute ang bawkin nangni pawhin in ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />In puten zâwlneite zîngah tu nge an tihduhdah loh? Mi fel tak, lo kal tûra thu hrilhlâwktute kha an that a, tûnah nangniho hi, chu mi fel tak mantîrtu leh thattute chu in ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Vântirhkohte pêk Dân dawngtu, zâwm duh si lote u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Chûng thu chu an hriatin an thin a khei ta hle a, a chungah thinurin an ha an ṭhial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Nimahsela, Stefana chu Thlarau Thianghlimin a khat a, vân lam a thlîr reng a, Pathian ropuina leh Pathian ding lama Isua ding a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, vân inhawng ka hmu a, Pathian ding lama Mihring Fapa ding pawh ka hmu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Chutichuan, ring takin an au va, an beng an hup a, Stefana chu an beih rawn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />khua ata chu an nam chhuak a, lungin an dêng ta a. Thuhretute chuan an puante chu tlangvâl pakhat, Saula an tih, ke bulah chuan an dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Stefanan, “Lalpa Isu, ka thlarau la ang che,” tia Lalpa a koh lai chuan lungin an dêng ruih ruih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />A ṭhingṭhi a, ring takin, “Lalpa, he an thiltih sual mawh hi anmahni phurhtîr suh ang che,” a ti a. Chu thu chu a sawi zawh chuan a muhîl ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saula pawh chuan Stefana thah chu a remti ve rêng a. Chumi ni aṭang chuan Jerusalem-a kohhran chu nasa takin an tiduhdah ta a. Tichuan, tirhkohte chauh lo chu Judai leh Samari ram khaw tinah an darh ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian ngaihsak ṭhenkhatten Stefana chu an phûm a, nasa takin an ṭah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saula erawh chu kohhranho nuai bo tumin inahte a lût a, a hmei a pain a hnûk chhuak a, tân inahte a khung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, a darhte chu hmun tinah an kal a, Chanchin Ṭha an hril zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Filipa chu Samari khawpuiah a chhuk a, an hnênah Krista thu a hril a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mipuiten Filipa thu sawi an hriata, a thil mak tihte an hmuh chuan a thusawite chu an bengkhawn tlâng hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ramhuai bawlhhlawhte chu ring taka auvin mi tam tak kawchhûng ata an lo chhuak a, zeng leh kebai tam tak pawh tihdam an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu khua chu an lâwm ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu khuaah chuan mi pakhat, Simona an tih, dawithiam a awm a. Mi ropui tak niin a insawi a, Samari mite chuan a dawi chu mak an ti êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi zawng zawngin, a lian a têin a thu chu an bengkhawn hle ṭhîn, “He mi hi Pathian thiltihtheihna, ‘Ropui,’ an tih kha a nih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A mitdawivaih thiam chu hun rei tak mak ti taka a lo siam tawh avângin a thu chu an ngaichâng ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian ram Chanchin Ṭha leh Isua Krista hming Filipan a hril chu an rin tâkah chuan, a hmei a pain baptisma an chang ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Simona meuh pawhin a ring ve ta a, baptisma a chang a, Filipa chu a kawp ta tlat a, chhinchhiahna leh thil mak ropui tak a tihte chu a hmu a, mak a ti êm êm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem-a tirhkoh awmte chuan Samari khaw miten Pathian thu an awih ta tih an hriat chuan an hnênah Petera leh Johana an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anni chu an zu kal a, Thlarau Thianghlim an dâwn theih nân an ṭawngṭaisak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An zînga tu mahin Thlarau Thianghlim chu an la dawng rih lo; Lalpa Isua hmingin baptisma an chang chauh a la ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, tirhkohten an lu chungah kut an nghat a, Thlarau Thianghlim an dawng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tirhkohten an chunga kut an nghahin Thlarau Thianghlim pêk an ni tih Simona chuan a hmuhin pawisa pêk a tum a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Hetiang thiltihtheihna hi mi pe ve rawh u, an chunga kut ka nghahna apiangin Thlarau Thianghlim an dawn ve theih nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, Peteran a hnênah, “I tangka nên hian boral rawh u: Pathian thilthlâwn pêk tangka suma lei i tum avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I rilru put dân Pathian mit hmuhah a dik lo va, hêng thilah hian tel vena leh chanvo i nei ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, i sual hi sim la, Lalpa hnênah ṭawngṭai la, i ngaihtuahna sual hi a ngaidam mial mahna che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Awhna rilru chhe tak i pu a, sualin a phuar tlat che tih ka hmu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Simona chuan, “I thil sawite chu eng mah ka chunga a lo thlen loh nân nangnin Lalpa hnênah mi dîlsak rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa thu chu an hriattîra an sawi hnu chuan, Petera leh Johana chu Jerusalem lamah an haw leh ta a. An haw pah chuan Samari rama khaw tam takah Chanchin Ṭha an hril a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpa tirh vântirhkohvin Filipa chu a bia a, “Tho la, Jerusalem aṭanga Gaza khaw zuk chhun, chhim lam thlalêr kal tlang kawngah khuan kal rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, a tho va, a kal ta a. Tin, Ethiopia rama mi pakhat an lalnu Kandaki hnuaia mi tilreh lal tak, a sum zawng zawng enkawltu chu Jerusalemah Pathian be tûrin a han kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />a haw lamah chuan tawlailîra ṭhu chungin zâwlnei Isaia lehkhabu a chhiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thlarauvin Filipa hnênah, “Tawlailîr saw pan la, va pawh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, Filipa chu a va tlân a, mi tilrehin zâwlnei Isaia lehkhabu a chhiar chu a ngaithla a, “I chhiar chu a awmzia i hria em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Tu ma mi hrilh fiah lohvin engtin nge ka hriat ang?” a ti a. Filipa chu a bula ṭhu-a chuang ve tûrin a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lehkha Thu a chhiar lai chu hei hi a ni: “Berâm talh tûr angin ani chu an hruai a, Berâmno a hmul mêttu hmaa a ngawi reng angin, Ani pawhin a ka a âng lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tihmualpho a ni a, dik lo taka rêlsak a ni, A thlahte chanchin tuin nge la sawi ang? Khawvêl aṭangin a nun an lâksak ta si a,” tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mi tilreh chuan Filipa hnênah, “Zâwlnei hian tu thu nge a sawi, ama thu nge mi dang thu? Mi hrilh teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Filipa chuan Lehkha Thu aṭang chuan sawi ṭanin, Isua chanchin a hrilh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chutia kalkawnga an kal lai chuan tui awmna an thleng a, mi tilreh chuan, “En teh, heta hi tui a awm a, baptisma ka chan engin nge dâl?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tichuan, tawlailîr chu a tiding a, Filipa leh mi tilreh chu an pahnihin tuiah chuan an chhuk a; Filipa chuan a baptis ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tui ata an lo chhuah chhoh chuan Lalpa Thlarauvin Filipa chu a la bo ta a. Mi tilreh chuan a hmu ta lo va; nimahsela, hlim takin a kal ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Filipa chu Azota khuaah miin an lo hmu a, Kaisari khua a thlen hma chu khaw tinah a kal a, Chanchin Ṭha a hril zêl a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saula erawh chuan Lalpa zirtîrte chu thah atân a la vau ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kawnga mite, a hmei a pa, a hmuh apiang mana, Jerusalem-a a rawn hruai theihna tûrin Damaska khaw sunagog hotute pêk tûr lehkha Puithiam lalber a va dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Damaska pana a kal laiin, a thlen dâwn ruaiah, thâwklehkhatan vân aṭangin êng a vêlin a lo êng ta phut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leiah a tlu a; aw a hria a, “Saula, Saula, engati nge mi tihduhdah?” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Lalpa, tu nge i nih?” a ti a. Aw chuan, “Isua, i tihduhdah hi ka ni e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tho la, khuaah lût la, i tih tûr an lo hrilh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kalpuite chu hrilhhai takin an ding a, aw chu an hre na a, tu mah an hmu si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Saula chu a lo tho va, a han meng a, eng mah a hmu thei ta lo va; tichuan, an kai a, Damaska-ah chuan an hruai lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ni thum khaw hmu lovin a awm a, eng mah a eiin a in lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Damaska-ah chuan zirtîr pakhat, Anania a awm a. Lalpa chu a hnênah a inlâr a, “Anani,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Lalpa, heta hi ka awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Tho la, kawtthlêr, ‘ngîl,’ an tihah chuan kal la, Juda inah Tarsa khuaa mi Saula zawng chhuak rawh. Ani chu a ṭawngṭai mêk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />mi pakhat, Anania lo lûta, a mit tivâr tûra a chunga kut a nghat a hmu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anania erawh chuan, “Lalpa, chu mi chuan Jerusalem-a i mi thianghlimte nasa takin a tiduhdah tih mi tam takin mi hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hetah pawh i hming lamtu zawng zawng man theihna thu puithiam lalte hnên aṭanga hmua lo kal a ni asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Kal mai rawh, he mi hi Jentail-te, lalte leh Israel-te hnêna ka hming pu lûttu atâna ka mi ruat a ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka hming avângin hrehawm engtia nasa nge a la tuar dâwn amah ka la hriattîr ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Anania chu a chhuak a, inah chuan a va lût a, a chunga kut nghatin, “Unau Saul, i mit a vâr leh theih nân leh Thlarau Thianghlima i khah theih nân, i lo kalna kawnga i hnêna inlâr Lalpa Isua khân i hnênah mi rawn tîr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thâwklehkhatah a mit a vâr leh ta a. Tichuan, a tho va, baptisma a chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chaw a ei a, a lo harh leh ta a. Damaska-ah chuan zirtîrte hnênah ni eng emaw zât a châm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sunagog-ahte chuan Isua chu Pathian Fapa a ni tih a hril ṭan ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A thu sawi hria zawng zawngin mak an ti hle a, “He mi hi Jerusalem-a he Hming lamtute tiduhdahtu kha a ni lâwm ni? Puithiam lalte hnêna hruai atân he Hming lamtute man tumin hetah pawh a lo kal a ni lâwm ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Saula thu sawi chuan mi a hneh deuh deuh va, Isua chu Mesia a ni tih chiang takin a hrilh fiah ṭhin avângin Damaska-a Juda-te chu a tidang a, a tibuai zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ni rei tak chhûng chu Saula thah tumin Juda-te an inrâwn khâwm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amah an phiar tih Saulan a lo hria a. Thah tumin chhûn leh zân kulh kawngkaahte an châng reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, a zirtîrten ani chu an hruai a, zânah kulh bang pâwnah bâwmin an thlâk thla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Saulan Jerusalem a lo thlen chuan zirtîrte zînga tel a tum a, anni erawh chuan zirtîr a nih ve an ring thei lo va, an za-in an hlau hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nimahsela, Barnaba chuan tirhkohte hnênah a kalpui a, kalkawnga Lalpa a hmuha, Lalpan amah a biak thu te, Damaska-a Isua hminga huai taka thu a hril chanchin te a hrilh hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, Saula chu Jerusalem-ah chuan an zîngah a chêng ve ta a. Lalpa hmingin huai takin thu a hril ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Grik ṭawng hmang Juda-te hnênah pawh thu a sawi a, a hnial a, anni chuan thah an lo tum ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Unauten chu chu an hriatin Kaisari khuaah an hruai chhuk a, Tarsa khuaah an kaltîr ta daih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Judai ramah te, Galili ramah te, Samari ramah te, ram pumah kohhran mite chu muang takin an awm a, an intinghet deuh deuh va, Lalpa ṭih takin an khawsa a. Thlarau Thianghlimin a thlamuan a, an lo pung ta telh telh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Petera khaw fang chuan Luda khuaa mi thianghlimte a zu tlawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutah chuan mi pakhat Ainia, a zen avânga kum riat lai khuma mu tawh a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Petera chuan a hnênah, “Aini, Isua Krista chuan a tidam a che, tho la, i khum kha siam fel rawh,” a ti a. Tichuan, a tho ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Luda leh Saron phaia awm zawng zawngten Ainia chu an hmu a, Lalpa lam an hawi ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Joppa khuaah zirtîr pakhat, Tabiti a awm a, a Grik hming chu Dorki a ni, chu chu sazukla tihna a ni. Thil ṭha ti leh retheite thil pe-a inhmang zo mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan a dam lo va, a thi ta mai a. An bual fai a, pindan chungnungah an zalh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Luda chu Joppa khaw kiang lawka awm a ni a. Luda khuaah Petera a awm tih zirtîrten an hriat chuan, “Khawngaih takin lo kal thuai teh,” tia ngên tûrin a hnênah mi pahnih an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tichuan, Petera chu a tho va, an rual chuan a kal ve ta nghâl a. A va thlen chuan pindan chungnungah an hruai chho va, hmeithai zawng zawng chu a kiangah an ding a, an ṭap a. Dorkiin a dam laia kawr leh thawmhnaw dang a siamsakte chu an entîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Petera chuan an vaiin a chhuahtîr vek a, ṭhingṭhiin a ṭawngṭai a, ruang lam chu a hawi a, “Tabit, tho rawh,” a ti a. Tichuan, Tabiti chu a lo meng a, Petera chu a hmu a, a ṭhuchhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Petera chuan a ban a, a kai tho va, mi thianghlimte leh hmeithaite chu a ko va, damin an hnênah a hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chu chu Joppa khaw pum puiin an hria a, mi tam takin Lalpa an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Petera chu Joppa-ah chuan ni rei tak a châm a, savun siamtu Simona inah a thleng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Kaisari khuaah mi pakhat, Kornelia a awm a, Itali Sipai pâwl an tiha sipai za hotu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ani chu Pathian ngaihsak mi a ni a, a chhûngte zawng zawng nên Pathian ṭih mi an ni. Juda mi retheite hnêna phal taka thilpêk pe ṭhîn mi a ni a. Pathian hnênah a ṭawngṭai fo ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni khat chu tlai dâr thum vêlah fiah takin inlârna a hmu a. Pathian tirh Vântirhkoh pakhat a hnênah a lo lût a, “Korneli,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kornelia chuan ani chu a en reng a, a hlau va, “Lalpa, eng nge ni?” a ti a. Vântirhkoh chuan, ‘I ṭawngṭaina leh i thil pêkte kha Pathianin a hre reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tûnah hian Joppa-ah mi tîr la, mi pakhat, Simona, Petera an tih chu kohtîr rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuipui kamah, savun siamtu Simona inah a thleng a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A betu Vântirhkoh chu a kal veleh, Kornelia chuan a chhiahhlawhte zînga mi pahnih leh sipai pakhat, Pathian ngaihsak tak, a tirhkah bîk ṭhinte zînga mi chu a ko va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thil awmzia zawng zawng chu a hrilh a, Joppa-ah chuan a tîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a tûk chhûn laiah chûng miten khua an thlen dâwn chuan, Petera chu ṭawngṭai tûrin in chung zâwlah a lâwn chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ril a ṭâm hle a, chaw ei a duh a; mahse, ei tûr an siam lai chuan zêlin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vân inhawng a hmu a, bâwm, puan hlai tak ang, a kil li-a hlin hi leia lo uai thla a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bâwm chhûngah chuan ran ke pali nei te, bawkvâka kal leh tleng chi te, chunglêng sava tinrêngte a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw hian, “Peter, tho rawh, talh la, ei rawh,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Petera erawh chuan, “Ni lo ve, Lalpa, thiang lo leh bawlhhlawh eng mah ka ei ngai hlei nêm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw chuan, “Pathianin a tihthianghlim tawh chu nangin bawlhhlawh ti suh,” a rawn ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutiangin vawi thum a rawn ti a. Bâwm chu vâna khai chhoh a ni leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Peteran a thil hmuh chu a ngaihna hre lova a awm lai chuan, Kornelia mi tirhte kha Simona in zâwt chhuakin, a kawt kawngkhâr bulah an lo ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Hetah hian Simon Petera a thleng em?” tiin an lo zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Peteran a inlârna hmuh chu a ngaihtuah laiin, Thlarauvin a hnênah, “Mi pathumin an zawng a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tho la, chhuk rawh, eng mah ringhlel lovin anmahni zui ang che; anni chu ka tirh an ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, Petera chu a chhuk a, mite hnênah chuan, “In zawn chu ka ni e. Eng nge in lo kal chhan?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Pathian ṭih mi, Juda hnam zawng zawngin an fak, sipai za hotu fel tak Kornelia chu vântirhkoh thianghlimin a bia a, i thu sawi a ngaihthlâk theih nân, a ina kala sâwm tûr chein a hrilh a, keini hi min rawn tîr a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chu mite chu a ko lût a, a riahtîr ta a. A tûkah chuan Petera chu a tho va, chu mite chu a zui ta a, Joppa-a unau ṭhenkhatte pawhin Petera chu an zui ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A tûk lehah chuan Kaisari chu an thleng ta a. Kornelia chuan a laichîn unaute leh a ṭhian ṭhate a lo sâwm khâwm a, Petera te chu an lo nghâk reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Peteran in a luh dâwn chuan Kornelia chuan a lo hmuak a, a ke bulah a bawkkhup a, chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Petera chuan ani chu a kai tho va, “Tho rawh, kei pawh mihring mai ka nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Inbe zêl chungin an lût a, mi tam tak awm khâwm chu a va hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, “Juda-te tân hnam dang zînga chêttlat leh anmahni tlawh a thian lohzia nangni ngeiin in hria e. Nimahsela, tu mah thiang lo leh bawlhhlawh ka ti tûr a ni lo tih Pathianin chiang takin mi hriattîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chuvângin, mi rawn sâwm veleh hnial lovin ka lo kal a nih hi. Eng nge mi rawn sâwm chhan le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kornelia chuan, “Vawiin hi a ni lina a ni ta, tûn ang hun tlai dâr thumah ka ṭawngṭai laiin, ngai teh, mi pakhat puan vâr sin ka bulah a lo ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />‘Korneli, i ṭawngṭaina leh i thil pêkte Pathianin a hre reng e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chutichuan, Joppa-ah mi tîr la, Simon Petera kohtîr rawh. Tuipui kamah savun siamtu Simona inah a thleng a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chuvângin, i hnênah mi ka rawn tîr ta nghâl a ni; i lo kal thei hi a ṭha e. Tûnah hian Lalpan thu a pêk apiang che ngaithla tûrin Pathian hmaah kan za hian kan lo awm khâwm a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Petera chuan, “Pathianin mi duhsak bîk a neih lohzia ka hre chiang ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hnam tin zîngah tu pawh amah ṭiha, thil dik taka ti apiang a lâwm zâwng mi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Israel fate hnênah Pathian chuan thu a rawn thlen a, remna Chanchin Ṭha chu Isua Krista hmangin a rawn puang ngei a; mahse, Isua chu mi zawng zawng Lalpa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Johanan baptisma thu a hril hnua Galili rama inṭan, Judai ram puma thil lo thleng thu kha in lo hre tawh phawt ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nazaret Isua chu Pathianin Thlarau Thianghlim leh thiltihtheihnain a thuam a, Pathian chuan a awmpui reng a, thil ṭha tia zin vêlin Diabola sawisak zawng zawng a tidam zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Judai ram leh Jerusalem-a a thil tih zawng zawng hretute kan ni; ani chu krawsa khêngbetin an tihlum a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mahse, Pathianin ni thum ni-ah a kaitho leh a, a inlârtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mi tin hmuhah erawh chuan a inlâr lo, Pathianin hretu atâna a lo ruat lâwk keiniho chauh hian kan hmu; a thawhleh hnu khân kan eiin kan in ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chu chu tlângaupui tûr leh, Ani chu mi nung leh mitthi chunga rorêltua Pathian ruat chu a ni tih mite hriattîr tûrin thu min pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Zâwlnei zawng zawng pawhin, amah ring apiang a hming avângin an sual ngaihdam a ni ang tih an lo hril ṭhîn a nih kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Peteran chûng thu chu a sawi laiin, a ngaithlatu zawng zawng chungah chuan Thlarau Thianghlim a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Serh tanho zînga ringtu, Petera rawn zuitute chuan, Thlarau Thianghlim thilpêk, Jentail-te hnênah pawh pêk a ni ve chu mak an ti êm êm a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />ṭawng hriat lohtea thu an sawi leh Pathian an fak chu an hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Peteran, “Hêng mite hian kan dâwn ang bawk khân Thlarau Thianghlim an dawng si a, tui hmanga baptisma an chan tuin nge khap thei ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua Krista hminga baptisma chan tûr thu a pe a. Chûng zawhah chuan châm rih tûrin an ngên a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judai ram tina tirhkohte leh unau awmte chuan Jentail-te pawhin Pathian thu an awih ve tih an hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Peteran Jerusalem a thlen chhoh leh chuan, ‘serh tan a ṭûl,’ tituten an lo sawisêl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Serh tan lohte i tlawh a, an zîngah chaw te i ei mai a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, Petera chuan a bul aṭanga indawt zêlin an hnênah a hrilh fiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Joppa-ah ka awm a, ka ṭawngṭai laiin zêlin ka awm a, bâwm, puan hlai tak ang kil li-a hlin, vân ata ka bula lo uai thla ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka en reng a, ka ngaihtuah a, leia mi ran ke pali nei te, ramsa te, bawkvâk leh tleng chi te, chunglêng sava te a chhûngah chuan ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tin, awin, ‘Peter, tho la, talh la, ei rawh,’ mi han tiin ka hre bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei chuan, ‘Ni lo ve, Lalpa, thiang lo leh bawlhhlawh eng mah rêng ka kaah a lût ngai lo,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vân ata aw chuan, ‘Pathianin a tihthianghlim tawh chu nangin bawlhhlawh ti suh,’ mi han ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutiang hlîr chuan vawi thum a lo awm a, a vaiin vânah khai chhoh a ni leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan mi pathum, Kaisari aṭanga ka hnêna an rawn tirhte chu ka thlen in kawtah an lo ding reng tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thlarauvin hreh lova anmahni zui tûrin mi hrilh a. Hêng unau paruk pawh hian mi zui ve a, Kornelia inah chuan kan va lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani chuan a ina Vântirhkoh a hmuh thu leh a hnêna, ‘Joppa-ah mi tîr la, Simon Petera kohtîr rawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ani chuan thu a hrilh ang chia, a thu sawi avâng chuan nang leh i chhûngte zawng zawng chhandam in ni ang,’ a tih thute mi lo hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thu chu ka han sawi ṭan a, Thlarau Thianghlim chu, a tîra kan chunga a lo thleng ang bawk khân an chungah a lo thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpan, ‘Johanan tuiin a baptis ṭhîn a, nangni erawh chu Thlarau Thianghlima baptis in ni ang,’ a tihte kha ka hre chhuak leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keini, Lalpa Isua Krista ringtute min pêk ang thilpêk thuhmun reng Pathianin an hnênah pawh a pêk ve miau si chuan, kei tehlul hian Pathian ka hnial thei dâwn em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chûng thu an hriat chuan an ngawi ta a, “Chuti a nih chuan Pathianin Jentail-te pawh sima nung tûrin kawng a hawnsak ve ta a nih chu,” tiin Pathian an fak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Stefana avânga tihduhdahte kha Foiniki ramah te, Kupra thliarkârah te, Antiokei khaw thleng tein an kal darh a. Juda-te hnênah chauh lo chuan tu hnênah mah thu an hril lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An zînga ṭhenkhat chu Kupra thliarkâra mi leh Kurini khaw mite an ni a. Chûng mite chuan Antiokei an thlen chuan Grik mite hnênah pawh thu an sawi a. Lalpa Isua Chanchin Ṭha an hrilh ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpan anni chu a pui a, mi tam takin an ring a, Lalpa lam an hawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An chanchin chu Jerusalem-a Kohhran beng a lo thleng a, anni chuan Barnaba chu Antiokei-ah an tîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A zu thlen chuan Pathian khawngaihna hnathawh chu a hmu a, a lâwm hle a. Rinawm taka Lalpa vuan tlat tûrin an za-in a fuih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Barnaba chu mi ṭha tak, Thlarau Thianghlim leh rinnaa khat a ni. Tichuan, mi tam tak Lalpa hnênah hruai an ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Barnaba chu Saula zawng tûrin Tarsa lamah a kal leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A han hmuh chuan Antiokei-ah a rawn hruai a, kum khat zet kohhran mite zîngah an tel ve a, mi tam tak an zirtîr ṭhîn a. Antiokei khuaah hian a ni, zirtîrte chu, ‘Kristian,’ an tih hmasak ber ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Jerusalem aṭangin zâwlnei ṭhenkhat Antiokei-ah an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An zînga mi pakhat Agaba chu a ding a, Thlarau hriattîrin ram tina ṭâmpui mitthi a tlâk tûr thu a hrilh lâwk a. Klaudia lal laiin ṭâm chu a tla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zirtîrte chuan an theih ang tâwk ṭheuhva thawhin Judai rama unau awmte ṭanpuina thawn an tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An tum ang chuan an ti a, upate hnênah Barnaba leh Saula kutah an thawn ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chutih lai chuan lal Herodan kohhranho zînga mi ṭhenkhat a tiduhdah ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jakoba, Johana unaupa chu, khandaihin a sât hlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu chuan Juda-te a tilâwm tih a hriatin Petera pawh chu man a tum leh ta zêl a (Chu chu Chhang dawidim telh loh Kût lai a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Petera chu a man a, tân inah a khung a, sipai pâwl li, pali zêla inchhâwkin a vêntîr a. Kalhlên kût zawha mipui hmaa hruai chhuah a tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chu Kohhran miten ṭhahnemngai takin Pathian hnênah an ṭawngṭaisak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Herodan hruai chhuah a tum dâwn zân chuan Petera chu a bân khing hniha hlinin sipai pahnih kârah a muhîl a. A dangte chuan kawngkhâr bula dingin an vêng tlat bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai teh, Lalpa tirh Vântirhkoh pakhat a lo ding a, rip chhûng chu a lo êng ta a; Petera chu a nâkah a bêng harh a, “Tho thuai rawh,” a ti a. Khaidiat pawh chu a bân ata a tla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vântirhkoh chuan “Insiam la, i pheikhawk bun rawh,” a ti a. Chutiang chuan a ti a. Vântirhkoh chuan “I kawr ha la, mi zui rawh,” a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Petera chuan a zui chhuak ta a. Vântirhkoh thiltih chu a tak a ni tih a hre lo va, zêla awm emaw a inti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vêngtu hmasa ber leh a dawttu chu an kal pêl a, khawpui lama kal chhuahna tûr thîr kawngkhâr chu an va thleng a, chu kawngkhâr chu amahin a inhawng ta a, an kal chhuak a, kawtthlêr pakhata an kal laiin vântirhkoh chuan a kalsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Petera chu a lo harh chiang a, “Lalpan a vântirhkoh a rawn tîr a, Heroda kut ata leh Juda-ten ka chunga thleng ngei tûra an ngaih lak ata mi chhan chhuak a ni tih tûnah ka hre chiang ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thil awmzia a hriat fiah hnu chuan, Johan Marka nu Mari inah chuan a va kal a, chutah chuan mi tam tak an awm khâwm a, an lo ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Petera chuan kawngkhâr chu a kik a, nula pakhat, Rodi chu kawng hawng tûrin a va kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Petera aw a hriat chuan a lâwm lutuk a, kawng hawng lovin a tlân lût leh a, kawngkhâr bulah Petera a ding tih a va hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anni chuan, “I â ta a nih hi,” an lo ti a. Ani chu a ṭang tlat a; mahse anni chuan, “Amah vêngtu Vântirhkoh a nih chu,” an ti leh zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Petera chuan kawngkhâr chu a kik leh ṭhîn a. Kawng an han hawn chuan amah chu an hmu ta a, mak an ti êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chuan anniho chu ngawi tûrin a kutin a zâp a, Pathianin tân in ata a hruai chhuah dânte chu a hrilh ta a. “Hêng thu hi Jakoba leh unaute va hrilh rawh u,” a ti a. A chhuak a, hmun dangah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khua a lo vâr chuan vêngtu sipaite chu, “Khawiah nge Petera a awm tâk?” tiin an buai chhe ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Heroda pawhin a zawng chiam a; mahse, a hmu si lo va; vêngtute chu a chhuahchhâl a, anni chu tihhlum tûrin thu a pe a. Heroda chu Judai ram ata Kaisari-ah a kal chhuk a, chutah chuan a châm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Heroda chu Tura leh Sidon mite chungah a thinur hle a. Anni chu thu khat vuain amah be tûrin an lo kal a, lal upa Blasta chu lamṭangah an siam a. An ramin Heroda rama pûr chaw ṭhîn an nih avângin inrem an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Inbiakna tûr ni-ah chuan Heroda chu lal kawr ha-in lalṭhutthlêngah a ṭhu a, an hnênah thu a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Pathian aw a ni, mihring aw a ni lo,” tiin mipuite chu an lo au ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani chuan chawimawina chu Pathian hnêna a pêk loh avângin Lalpa tirh vântirhkohvin chawplehchilhin a man a, rûlhûtin a ei a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian thu erawh chu a darh a, ringtu an pung ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Barnaba leh Saulan an rawngbâwl hna an zawh chuan Johan Marka hruaiin Jerusalem aṭangin an kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Antiokei kohhran mite zîngah chuan zâwlneite leh zirtîrtute an awm a. Chûngte chu: Barnaba te, Sumeona, Nigera an tih te, Kurini mi Lukia te, lal Herodan unauva a neih Manaina te, Saula te an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chaw ngheia Lalpa an biak ho laiin Thlarau Thianghlimin, “Barnaba leh Saula hi anmahni ka ruat chhan ti tûrin mi tihhransak rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, chaw an nghei a, an ṭawngṭai a, an chungah kut an nghat a, an tîr chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Thlarau Thianghlim tirh chhuahin Selukai khuaah an chhuk a, chuta ṭang chuan Kupra thliarkârah lawngin an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Salamis khua an thlen chuan Juda-ho sunagog-ahte Pathian thu an hril a. Johana pawh anmahni ṭanpuitu atân an hruai ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thliarkâr chu a pumin, Pafos khaw thlengin an fang chhuak a. Dawithiam, zâwlnei der, Juda mi pakhat, Bar-Isua an hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu mi chu Ramawptu fing tak Sergia Paula hnêna awm a ni. Chu Ramawptu chuan Barnaba leh Saula chu lêngah a sâwm a, Pathian thu hriat a duh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eluma, dawithiam (chu chu a hming awmzia a ni) chuan Ramawptu chu rinna thu chu awih lohtîr a tum a, anni chu a lo dodâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saula, Paula an tih bawk chu, Thlarau Thianghlimin a khat a, ani chu a en reng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Nang bumna tinrêng leh suahsualna tinrênga khatpa, nang Diabola fapa, nang thil ṭha zawng zawng dodâltu, Lalpa kawng tluang tihbuai i bâng lo vang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hre rawh, tûnah Lalpa kut i tuar dâwn a ni, i mit a del ang a, khaw êng i hmu rih lo vang,” a ti a. Chu veleh chhûm leh thimin amah chu a bawh a, kaitu tûr zawngin a phar ta ruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ramawptu chuan chu chu a hmuhin a ring ta a, Lalpa thu an zirtîrna chuan a hneh hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Paula leh a ṭhiante chu Pafos aṭang chuan lawngin an chhuak a, Pamfulia rama Perga khua an thleng a. Johana khân anni chu a hawsan a, Jerusalem-ah a kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Perga aṭang chuan Pisidia rama Antiokei khuaah an kal zêl a, sabat niin sunagog-ah inkhâwmin an ṭhu ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dân bu leh Zâwlnei Lehkhabu chhiar hnu chuan sunagog hotute chuan mi an tîr a, “Unaute u, min fuihna tûr thu eng emaw in neih chuan sawi rawh u,” an va ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, Paula chu a ding a, kutin a zâp a, a sawi ta a: “Nangni Israel mite leh Pathian ṭihtute u, ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hêng Israel mite Pathian hian kan pute kha a thlang a, an mikhualna Aigupta rama an awm chhûng khân hnam ropui takah a din a, chuta ṭang chuan a thiltihtheihna ropui tak hmangin a hruai chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kum sawmli chhûng lai thlalêrah dawhthei takin a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Kanan rama hnam sarih a tihtlâwm hnu khân an ram chu a luahtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chûng chuan kum zali leh sawmnga chhûng lai a awh a. Chûng hnuah chuan rorêltute a pe ṭhîn a, zâwlnei Samuela thleng khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan lal an dîl a, Pathianin Benjamina chi a mi, Kisa fapa Saula, kum sawmli chhûng atân a pe leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A lalna a tihtâwp hnuah Pathianin Davida a laltîr a, ‘Ka mi duhzâwng tak, Jesaia fapa Davida ka chhar ta, ani chuan ka duhzâwng apiang a ti ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chu mi thlahte zîng aṭang chuan, Pathianin a thutiam ang zêlin, Israel-ho hnênah Chhandamtu Isua a rawn pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Isuan rawng a bâwl ṭan hmain Johanan, sima baptisma chan tûr a nih thu Israel mi zawng zawng hnênah a lo hril hmasa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Johana chuan, a rawngbâwlna a hlen chhuah dâwn lai khân, ‘Nangnin tu-ah nge mi ruat? Ani chu ka ni lo ve. Ngai teh u, ka hnungah a lo kal mêk a ni, a pheikhawk phelhsak tlâk pawh ka ni lo ve,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ka unau, Abrahama thlahte leh nangni Pathian ṭih zawng zawngte u, chu Chhandamtu chanchin chu kan zaa hnênah a lo thleng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem-a awmte leh an rorêltuten ani chu an hre lo va, sabat ni apianga an chhiar ṭhin zâwlneite thu an hriatthiam loh avângin ani chu thiam loh an chantîr a, zâwlneite thu chu an thlen kimtîr ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thihna khawp meuh a chungah eng mah an hmuh loh pawhin tihlum tûrin Pilata an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A chanchin ziak zawng zawng kha a thlen zawhin kraws ata an la thla a, thlânah an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathianin ani chu mitthi zîng ata a kaitho leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Galili ram aṭanga Jerusalem-a ama ruala chho vete hnênah ni rei tak chhûng a inlâr ṭhîn a; chûng mite chu tûnah hian Israel mite hnêna a thuhretute an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Keini pawh hi Pathianin min thlahtute hnêna a lo tiam Chanchin Ṭha chu hriattîr tûr che u-in kan lo kal a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />keini an thlahte hnêna Isua kaithova a rawn hlen tâk thu hi. pahnihnaah: ‘Nang zawng ka fapa i ni e, Vawiin hian fa-ah ka neih ta a che,’ tih ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, a ruang pawh ṭawih lova a kaihthawh tûr thu: ‘Davida hnêna ka thutiam thianghlim, Thlâwn lo tûr chu ka pe ang che,’ tia a sawi ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chuvângin, hmun dangah pawh, ‘I mi thianghlim hi a ṭawih i phal lo vang,’ a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Davida zawng a dam chhûngin Pathian duhzâwnga rawng a bâwl hnuah a muhîl a, a thlahtute bulah an phûm a, a ṭawih ral tawh alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pathianin a kaihthawha erawh kha chu a ṭawih ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chutichuan, unaute u, hre rawh u; amah avânga sual ngaihdamna thu hi kan rawn hrilh che u a ni. Mosia Dâna thiam in chan theih lohna zawng zawngah khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Isua ringtu apiang thiam chantîr an ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chuvângin, fîmkhur rawh u, chutilo chuan, zâwlneite lehkhabua sawi kha in chungah a thleng dah ang e:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />‘Pathian hmusittute u, en rawh u, mak ti ula, boral rawh u. In dam chhûngin thil kawng khat ka tih hi; chu thil chu miin hrilh che u mah sela, in awih chuang tawp lo vang,’ tih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />An inkhâwm bâng lo chhuak chuan sabat leha chûng thu chu sawi leh tûrin an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Inkhâwm an ṭîn fel hnu chuan, Juda tam tak leh Juda saphun Pathian ngaihsak tam takin Paula leh Barnaba chu an zui a, anni chuan Pathian khawngaihnaa awm reng tûrin an lo fuih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Sabat lehah chuan Lalpa thu ngaithla tûrin a khua thawin an rawn inkhâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nimahsela, Juda-ten mipui an hmuh chuan an îtsîk ta êm êm a; Paula thu sawi chu an hnial kalh a, nasa takin an sawichhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Paula leh Barnaba chuan huai takin, “Pathian thu hi nangni hnêna hril hmasak tûr rêng a ni; nimahsela, in hnar a, chatuan nun nei tlâk lova in inngaih ahnu chuan, hre rawh u, Jentail-te lam kan hawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Chutianga ti tûrin Lalpan thu min pe a ni: ‘Jentail-te êng atân ka ruat a che, kâwlkil thlenga mite chhandamna atân,’ tih ziak ang khân,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Jentail-ten chu thu chu an hriat chuan an lâwm a, Lalpa chu an fak a, chatuan nun nei tûra ruat apiang chuan an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu chumi ram pumah chuan a darh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Nimahsela, Juda-te chuan miliannuho Pathian ngaihsakte leh khuaa mi pawimawhte chu an fuihpawrh a, Paula leh Barnaba chu an bei a, an ram ata an hnawt chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Anmahni an demzia tihlan nân tirhkohte chuan an kephah ata vaivut an thing thla a, Ikonion khuaah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Zirtîrhote chu Thlarau Thianghlimin an khat a, an lâwm ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutiang bawk chuan Ikonion-ah pawh Juda-te sunagog-ah tirhkohte chu an inkhâwm a, an thu sawi avângin Juda leh Grik tam takin an ring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ring duh lo Juda-te chuan Jentail-te an fuihpawrh a, unaute chu an huattîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mahse, tirhkohte chu rei fe an châm a, Lalpa thu chu huai takin an hril ṭhîn a. A khawngaihna thu an hril ṭhin chu nemngheh nân Lalpan anmahni hmangin chhinchhiahna leh thil mak tam tak a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuaa mipuite chu an inṭhen a, a ṭhenin Juda-te an ṭan a, a ṭhenin tirhkohte an ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jentail-te leh Juda-te leh an rorêltute chuan, sawisak hrepa lunga den an tum tih
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tirhkohten an hriatin, Lukaoni rama Lustra khuaah te, Derbe khuaah te leh a vêl ramah te an tlânsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chûngahte pawh chuan Chanchin Ṭha an hril zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lustra-ah chuan piangsual pakhat, ṭhu reng hi a awm a, a pian tirh ata kein a la kal ngai lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu mi chuan Paula thu sawi chu a ngaithla a, Paulan ani chu a en reng a, damna tûra rinna a nei tih a hriatin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ring takin, “I kein ding chhuak rawh,” a ti a. Ani chu a zuang tho va, kein a kal thei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mipuiten Paula thiltih chu an hmuhin, Lukaoni ṭawngin ring takin, “Pathiante chu mihring angin kan zîngah an lo chhuk ta a nih hi!” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Barnaba chu Zeusa an ti a, Paula chu thusawitu ber a nih avângin Hermea an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An Pathian Zeusa Tempul chu kawtchhuahah a awm a, chuta puithiam chuan bâwngpa leh pangpâr ṭhite khaw kulh kawngkaah chuan a rawn la a; mipuite nên chuan tirhkohte hnêna inthawina hlan an tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tirhkoh Barnaba leh Paulan chu chu an hriat chuan, an puan an pawtthlêr a, mipui zîngah chuan an zuang lût a, an au va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Pute u, hêng thil hi engah nge in tih? Keini pawh nangmahni ang mihring bawk kan nih hi. Hêng thil lawilo hi in hawisana, vân te, lei te, tuifinriat te leh a chhûnga thil awm zawng zawng siamtu Pathian Nung lam in hawi theihna tûrin Isua Chanchin Ṭha kan rawn hrilh che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian chuan tûn hmain hnam tin anmahni dân anga an awm a phal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuti chung pawhin chhui chhuah theih loh tûrin amah a inthup ngai lo; a thil ṭha tihin a inhriattîr a, vân aṭangin ruah a pe che u a, a hun tê-ah in thlaite a rahtîr a, ei tûr a pe che u a, in rilru a tihlim êm êm ṭhîn a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chûng thu chu sawiin mipuite chu an hnêna inthawina hlân lo tûrin an khap thei ta hrâm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, Antiokei leh Ikonion aṭangin Juda ṭhenkhat an lo kal a, mipuite chu an rawn hmin a, Paula chu lungin an dêng a, a thi emaw tiin khua ata an hnûk chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mahse, zirtîrten an din hual laiin ani chu a lo tho va, khuaah chuan a lût leh ta a. Tin, a tûkah chuan Barnaba nên Derbe-ah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chu khuaah chuan Chanchin Ṭha an hril a, mi tam tak zirtîrah an siam hnuin Lustra-ah an kîr leh a, Ikonion-ah te, Antiokei-ah te an kal zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Hrehawm tam tak tuarin Pathian ramah kan lût tûr a ni rêng a ni,” tiin zirtîrte rilru an tinghet a, rinna chu vuan tlat tûrin an fuih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kohhran tinah upate an ruat zêl a, chaw ngheiin an ṭawngṭai a, an rin Lalpa hnênah an kawltîr zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pisidia ram chu an fang chhuak a, Pamfulia an lo thleng leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Perga-ah thu an hril a, Atalia khuaah an chhuk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />lawngin an kal a, Antiokei an thleng leh ta a. He khua hi an hna thawh tâk thawk tûra unauten Pathian khawngaihnaa an kawltîra, an zin chhuah ṭanna kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An thlen chuan kohhran mite chu an ko khâwm a, Pathianin anmahni hmanga thil a tih zawng zawng leh Jentail-te tân pawh Isua rinna kawng a inhawn thu te an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zirtîrte hnênah chuan rei fe an châm ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judai ram aṭangin mi ṭhenkhat an lo chhuk a, “Mosia Dân anga serh in tan kher loh chuan chhandam in ni thei lo vang,” tiin unaute chu an rawn zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, Paula leh Barnaba te nên nasa takin an inhnial a, an inkalh tlat avângin Paula leh Barnaba leh an zînga mi ṭhenkhat, Jerusalem-a tirhkohte leh upate hnêna kal chhova, chu thu chu sawi tûrin an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, kohhran mite chuan an thlah a, Foiniki ram leh Samari ram an fang chhuak a, chûnga unau awmte hnênah chuan Jentail-ten Pathian thu an awih tâk thu chu an sawi zêl a; chu chuan a tilâwm hle hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem an han thlen chuan kohhran mite, tirhkohte leh upate chuan an lo lâwm a; Pathianin anmahni hmanga thil a tih zawng zawng an hnênah an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, Farisai pâwla mi, ringtu ṭhenkhat an ding chhuak a, “Jentail-te chu an serh tan tûr a ni a, Mosia Dân pawh zâwm tûrin phût tlat tûr a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu thu ngaihtuah tûr chuan tirhkohte leh upate chu an inkhâwm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rei tak an ngaihtuah hnuin Petera a ding a, an hnênah, “Unaute u, Jentailten keima ka aṭanga Chanchin Ṭha an hriata an rinna tûrin Pathianin hmâna in zîng ata mi thlan kha in hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rilru hretu Pathian chuan keini min pêk ang bawka an hnêna Thlarau Thianghlim pein, Jentail-te pawh a duh a ni tih a tihlan kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keini leh anni a thlei hrang lo va, an rin avângin an rilru a tithianghlim a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, min thlahtute leh keini zawh tawh loh nghâwngkawl kha, tûnah zirtîrte kova bah luihtîr tumin engati nge Pathian in hnial le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anmahni ang bawkin keini pawh Lalpa Isua khawngaihna avânga chhandam tûr niin kan inring si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, mipui zawng zawng chu an ngawi ta a, Barnaba leh Paula chuan anmahni hmanga Jentail-te zînga chhinchhiahna leh thil mak Pathianin a tihte an sawi chu an ngaithla ṭhuap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An ngawih tâk hnu chuan Jakoban a sawi ve a, “Unaute u, ka thu hi ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sumeona khân Pathianin Jentail-te ngaihsakin ama hming pu tûra an zînga mi a lâk chhuah ṭan thu a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chu thu leh zâwlnei thu ziak hi a inrem a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘Chûng hnu chuan ka kîr leh ang a, Davida bâwkte chim kha ka tungding leh ang; A chhe laite ka siam ṭha ang a, ka din thar leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, mi dangte pawhin Lalpa an zawng ang a, Jentail ka hming pu zawng zawngte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hmasâng aṭanga hêng thu hriattîrtu Lalpa chuan a ti a ni,’ tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Chuvângin, hetiang hian ti ila ka ti a ni: Jentail-te zînga Pathian thu awihte chu tibuai lo ila;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />milem biakna thil bawlhhlawh laka inthiarfihlîm tûr te, inngaih bânsana, sa rehhlum sa leh sa thisen ei lo tûrin lehkha i thawn zâwk ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mosia Dân chu hmasâng aṭangin khaw tinah an puang a, sunagog-ah te sabat ni apiangin an chhiar ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, tirhkohte leh upate chuan, kohhran mi zawng zawng nên, an zîng ata mi thlan chhuaha, Paula leh Barnaba ruala Antiokeia tirh nghâl ṭhain an hria a. Juda, Barsaba an tih leh Sila an thlang a, anni chu unaute zînga hruaitu deuhte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hetiang hian lehkha an ziak a, an kentîr a: “Tirhkohte leh upate leh in unaute hian, Antiokeia mi te, Suria rama mi te, leh Kilikia rama Jentail unau awmte chu chibai kan bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kan zînga mi ṭhenkhat in hnêna lo kalin, kan thu hmu si lovin an tibuai che u a, in rilru an timangang tih kan lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kan duh tak Barnaba leh Paula, kan Lalpa Isua Krista hming avânga thih huamte rual hian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />thukhat vuain, kan aiawh kan thlante in hnêna rawn tirh ṭhain kan hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, Juda leh Sila hi kan rawn tîr a ni; anni pawhin hêng thu bawk hi ṭawngkain an hrilh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thlarau Thianghlim leh keinin hêng thil pawimawh zual lo hi chu in chungah phurrit dang nghat lo ila ṭhain kan hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Milem biakna thil ei lo ula, sa thisen leh sa reh hlum sa ei lo ula, inngaih bânsan bawk ula kan ti: hêng thil lakah hian in inthiar fihlîm chuan in tân a ṭha ang, Dam takin,” tiin an ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, an kaltîr ta a, Antiokei an thleng thla a, mipui an ko khâwm a, lehkha chu an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />An han chhiar a, fuihna thu avâng chuan an lâwm ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Juda leh Sila chu zâwlnei an ni bawk a, unaute chu thu tam takin an fuih a, an tinghet a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Rei fe an châm hnuin, anmahni tîrtute hnêna thlamuang taka kîr leh tûrin unaute chuan an hâwntîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Paula leh Barnaba erawh chu Antiokei-ah chuan mi dang tam takte nên an awm ta reng a, Lalpa thu an hril a, an zirtîr ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ni eng emaw zât hnuah chuan Paulan Barnaba hnênah, “Kal leh ila, Lalpa thu kan hrilhna khaw tina unau awmte kha tlawh ila, engtin nge an awm tâk i kan teh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Barnaba chuan Johan Marka kha hruai leh a duh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Paula erawh chuan, Pamfulia ram aṭanga anmahni a kîrsana, an hnathawhnaa a kal ve zêl tâk loh avâng khân ani chu hruai leh mi niin a ngai lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tichuan, hmaisen khawpa an inhnial tâk avângin anni pawh chu an lo inṭhen ta a. Barnaba chuan Marka chu a hruai a, Kupra thliarkâr lamah lawngin an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Paula erawh chuan Sila a thlang a, unauten Lalpa khawngaihnaa an kawltîr hnuin an zin chhuak ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Suria ram leh Kilikia ram chu an fang chhuak a, kohhran mite chu an tinghet zêl a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Derbe khua tlawhin Lustra an thleng a, chutah chuan zirtîr pakhat Timothea a awm a, a nu chu ringtu Juda a ni a, a pa erawh chu Grik mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lustra leh Ikonion-a unaute chuan ani chu an fak hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Paulan zinpui atân a duh a, a pa chu Grik mi a ni tih an hre vek a, chûng lai vêla Juda-te avâng chuan a serh a tansak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khaw tinah an kal pahin Jerusalem-a tirhkohte leh upate thu rêl kha zâwm tûrin an hrilh zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, kohhran mite chu rinnaah an tinghet a, ni tin an pung deuh deuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asia rama thu hril lo tûrin Thlarau Thianghlimin a tih avângin Frugia leh Galatia inrina lai vêl chu an fang chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Musia ramri an thleng a, Bithunia rama luh an tum a, chu pawh chu Isua Thlarauvin a phal lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Musia ram chu an kal tlang a, Troas khua an thleng thla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Paulan zânah inlârna a hmu a, Makedonia rama mi pakhat dingin, “Makedonia ramah lo kai la, min pui rawh,” tiin a lo ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chu inlârna chu a hmuh zawh chuan Makedonia rama kal kan tum ta nghâl a, an hnêna Chanchin Ṭha hril tûrin Pathianin min ko niin kan hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Troas aṭang chuan lawngin kan chhuak a, tluang takin Samothraki khua kan thleng a, a tûkah Neapolis khua kan thleng leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan Filipi khuaah kan kal a. Chu khua chu Makedonia ram bial khaw pawimawh tak, Rom sawrkâr khua a ni. Chutah chuan ni eng emaw zât kan châm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sabat ni chuan kulh kawngkhâr pâwn lui kamah ṭawngṭaina hmun nia kan rinah chuan kan kal a; hmeichhe lo kal khâwmho hnênah chuan ṭhuin thu kan sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuatira khuaa mi nu pakhat, Ludi, Pathian ṭih, puan senduk zuartu chuan kan thu sawi a ngaithla ve a. Paula thusawite zâwm tûrin Pathianin a rilru a hawnsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A chhûngte nên baptisma an chang a, “Lalpa ring takzeta mi ruat chuan, ka inah lo thleng rawh u,” tiin min ngên a, min chelh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ni khat chu ṭawngṭaina hmuna kan kal lai chuan bawih nula pakhat, ramhuai pai, aien thiam hian min tâwk a. A aien thiam chu a pute chuan an hlâwkpui hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chu mi chuan Paula leh keini chu min zui a, “Hêng mite hi Pathian Chungnungbera bawihte an ni a, chhandamna kawng an rawn hrilh che u a nih hi,” tiin a au a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutiang chuan ni tam tak a ti a, Paula chuan a ngaithei ta lo va, a hawi a, ramhuai hnênah chuan, “Isua Krista hmingin thu ka pe a che; a kawchhûng ata lo chhuak rawh,” a ti a. Chutih lai tak chuan a lo chhuak ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A pute chuan an sum hnâr a chat ta tih an hriatin Paula leh Sila chu an man a; hotute hmaah, vântlâng pun khâwmnaah chuan an hnûk lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, rorêltute hnênah an hruai a, “Hêng mite hi Juda an ni a, kan khua an rawn tibuai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keini Rom mite zawm ve leh tih ve thiang lo dân dang an hril a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, mipuite pawh chu tirhkohte bei tûrin an lo thawk ve a; rorêltute chuan an kawrte an hlihsak a, tianga vuak thu an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An vuak nek hnuah tân inah an khung a, vêngtu hnênah chuan anni chu him taka vêng tûrin thu an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuti taka thu an pêk khauh avâng chuan anni chu tân in chhûngrilah a khung a, an keahte thing kawl a buntîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zânlai vêlah chuan Paula leh Sila chu Pathian hnênah an ṭawngṭai a, hla an sa a, mi tângten an ngaithla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thâwklehkhatah lîr nasa takin a lo nghîng a, tân in lungphûmte lamin a nghîng a, kawngkhâr zawng zawngte a inhawng a, tângho kawl bunte pawh chu a inphelh nghâl ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tân in vêngtu chu a lo harh a, mi tângte chu an tlân chhuak ta vek emaw a ti a, a ngûnhnâm a phawi a, intihhlum a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Paula chu ring takin a au va, “Eng mah intih suh, kan za-in hetah kan la awm vek alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chu veleh êng a lam a, a zuang lût a, hlauva khûr chungin Paula leh Sila hmaah chuan a bawkkhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Anni chu pâwnah a hruai chhuak a, “Pute u, chhandam ka nih theih nân eng nge ka tih tûr?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Lalpa Isua ring la; tichuan, chhandam i ni ang, nang leh i chhûngte nên,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amah leh a ina awm zawng zawng chu Lalpa thu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chumi zân, chumi dârkâr la la chuan Paula te chu a hruai a, an vuakna hliamte chu a silsak a, an chhûngin baptisma an chang ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, a inah a hruai a, ei tûr a hlui a, Pathian an rin tâk avângin an chhûngin an hlim ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A tûk zîngah rorêltuten, “Kha mite kha chhuah rawh,” tia hrilh tûrin tân in vêngtu hnênah pulis an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tân in vêngtu chuan an thu chu Paula a hrilh a, “Rorêltute chuan chhuah tûr che uin mi an rawn tîr a, tûnah lo chhuak ula, thlamuang takin kal rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nimahsela, Paula chuan an hnênah, “Rom mi kan ni a, thiam loh chang pawh kan ni si lo va, vântlâng hmuhin min vua a, tân inah min khung a. Tûnah a rûkin min chhuah an tum vei em ni? A ni tawp lo vang, anmahni ngei lo kal sela, min va hruai chhuak rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pulis-te chuan chûng thu chu rorêltute an va hrilh a. Rom mi an ni tih an hriat chuan an hlau ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />An va kal a, thupha an chawi a, an hruai chhuak a, an khua ata kal chhuak tûrin an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tichuan, tân in ata chu an chhuak a, Ludi inah an kal a, unaute chu an hmuh chuan an thlamuan a, an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Amfipoli leh Apolonia khua an kal tlang a, Thesalonika khua an thleng a, chutah chuan Juda-te sunagog a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Paula chu a tih dân pângngaiin a inkhâwm ve a; sabat vawi thum Lehkha Thu aṭangtea chhuipuiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Krista chu thihna tuar tûr a nihzia leh mitthi zîng ata tho leh tûr rêng a nihzia hrilh fiahin a kawhhmuh ṭhîn a. “He Isua, a chanchin kan hrilh che u hi, Krista chu a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, an zînga mi ṭhenkhatin an ring a, Paula leh Sila chu an pâwl ve ta a. Pathian ngaihsak Grik mi tam tak leh miliannu ṭhahnem takin an zui bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Juda-te chuan an îtsîk êm êm a, khawlaia mi sual tei mai maite chu an khâwm a, a khuain an chawk buai a, tirhkohte chu vântlâng hmaa hruai chhuah tumin Jasona in an rawn ṭhâwng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anni chu an hmu lo va, Jasona leh unau ṭhenkhatte chu khaw hotute hnênah an hnûk lût a, “Khawvêl chawk buaitute kha hetah pawh an lo kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jasona hian a lo thleng vei a. Hêngho hian an za-in, ‘Isua, lal dang a awm,’ tiin Kaisara thu kalhin thil an ti ṭhîn a ni,” tiin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chûng thu chuan khaw hotute leh mipui chu a tibuai hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jasona leh mi dangte hnên aṭangin an aia hrên tûr thil an la a, an chhuah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Unaute chuan a zân a zânin Paula leh Sila chu Beroia khuaah an kaltîr ta vat a. An va thlen chuan Juda-te sunagog-ah an inkhâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anni chu Thesalonika mite ai chuan an lo inhawng zâwk a. Châk takin thu an dawng a, an thu sawi chu a dik leh dik loh fiah nân ni tin Lehkha Thute an chhiar ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An zînga tam takin an ring ta a, Grik miliannu te leh mipa tam tak pawhin an ring ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, Thesalonika khuaa Juda-ten Paulan Beroia khuaah pawh Pathian thu a hril tih an hriat chuan, an lo kal a, mipui an fuihpawrh a, an tibuai leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Paula chu tuipui thlengin lawnga kal tûrin unaute chuan an hruai ta nghâl a. Sila leh Timothea erawh chu an la châm zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Paula hruaitute chuan Atheni khua an hruai thleng a, Sila leh Timothea chu Paula chuan a rang thei ang bera a hnêna lo kal tûrin a chah a, an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Paulan Atheni-ah a lo nghâk a, chu khua chu pathian limin a khat tih a hmuh chuan a vei ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, sunagog-ah Juda-te leh Pathian ngaihsakte chu Pathian thu a chhuipui ṭhîn a, vântlâng punkhâwmnaa lo kalte pawh a hmuh apiang ni tin thu a sawipui bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Epikuria mi ṭhenkhat leh Stoik mi fing ṭhenkhatte pawhin an rawn hnial a, “He bengchhengpa hian eng nge a sawi?” an ti a. Isua thu leh thawhleh thu a sawi avângin a ṭhen chuan, “Hnam dang pathiante thuhriltu a ni âwm e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, an hruai a, Areopagi-ah chuan an kalpui a. “He zirtîrna thar i sawi hi eng nge a nih kan ngaithla thei ang em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan beng hriatah thil danglam tak i rawn sawi a, chûng thil awmzia chu hriat kan duh e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Atheni mi zawng zawng leh mikhualte pawh thil dang ti lo lêkin thil thar sawi leh ngaihthlâk an chîng ṭhîn rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Paula chu Areopagi-a mite hmaah chuan a ding a, a sawi a: “Nangni Atheni khaw mite u, engkimah sakhaw mi tak in ni tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka lên paha chibai in bûkate ka en laiin maichâm pakhat, a chunga, ‘Hriat loh Pathian tân, tia ziak ka hmu a. Hre lova chibai in bûk ṭhina thu chu keiin ka rawn hrilh che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian, khawvêl leh a chhûnga thil awm zawng zawng siamtu chu, lei leh vân lal a nih avângin, kuta sak tempulahte a awm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thil tlachhama mihringte kuta rawngbâwlsak ngai lah a ni hek lo; amah ngei chu engkim hnêna nunna te, thâwkna te leh thil zawng zawng petu a ni zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lei chung hmun tina awm tûrin thlahtu pakhat aṭangin hnam tin a din a, an tân hun bi te a thliahsak a, an awmna tûr rite pawh a khamsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathian an zawna, an dap an dapa, an hmuh fuh hlauh theih nân a ti a ni; ani chuan min hlat lo ṭheuh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />‘Amah avângin kan nung, kan che, kan awm a ni si a,’ tia an sawi ang khân. Nangni zînga hla phuahtu ṭhenkhat pawhin, ‘Keini pawh a thlahte kan ni,’ tia an sawi ang kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathian thlahte kan nih si chuan, Pathian chu rangkachak emaw, tangkarua emaw, lung emaw, mihring themthiam leh remruata chherte ang emaw hi ni-ah kan ngai tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutianga Pathian kan hriat loh laite kha ani chuan a haider a; mahse, tûnah hian hmun tina mi sim tawh tûrin a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khawvêl pum pui hi dik taka ro a rêlsak hun tûr nî a ruat fel tawh a; a rêltu tûr pawh a ruat tawh: mi tin hriat atân chu mi chu mitthi zîng ata a kai tho a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mitthi zîng ata thawhlehna thu an hriat chuan, a ṭhenin an nuihzat a, a ṭhenin, “He thu hi ngaihthlâk leh kan duh e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tichuan, Paula chu an zîng ata a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Paula chu an zui zêl a, an ring ta a. Chûng zîngah chuan Areopagi rorêltu zînga mi Dionusia te, hmeichhe pakhat Damari te leh mi dang tam tak pawh an tel a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng hnu chuan Paulan Atheni a chhuahsan a, Korinth khuaah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Juda mi pakhat Akuila a hmu a, ani chu Ponto rama piang a ni. Rom lal Klaudian Juda zawng zawng Rom khua ata a hnawh chhuah avângin a nupui Priskili nên Itali ram aṭanga lo thleng hlim an ni. An hnênah a lêng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a hna thawh ang thawk ve an nih avângin a thlen chilh a, a thawhpui ve ṭhîn a; puan in an siam ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sabat ni apiangin sunagog-ah thu a sawi a; Juda-te leh Grik-te chu rintîr tumin a bei ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sila leh Timothea chu Makedonia ram aṭanga an lo thlen thlâk chinah chuan Paula chu thuhril hnaah a inpumpêk ta a; Isua kha Krista chu a ni tih Juda-te hnênah a hrilh fiah ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, Juda-ten an dodâl a, an sawichhiat tâkah chuan Paulan a puan a thing a, “In boral pawhin nangmahni mawh a ni ta e, kei zawng ka thiang ta. Tûn achinah chuan Jentail-te lam ka hawi tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan a kal chhuak a, mi pakhat, Tita Justa inah a lût a, ani chu Pathian ngaihsak tak a ni a; a in pawh sunagog bula awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sunagog hotu Krispa leh a chhûngte zawng zawngin Lalpa an ring a. Korinth khuaa mi tam tak pawhin an hria a, an ring a, baptisma an chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zan khat chu Paulan inlârna a hmu a, Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “Hlau suh, ngawi lovin thu sawi zêl rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei i hnêna ka awm avângin tina tûr chein tu man i chungah kut an lek lo vang, he khuaah hian mi tam tak ka nei si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Paula chu an zîngah Pathian thu zirtîrin kum khat leh thla ruk a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Galiova chu Akaia ram awptu a nih laiin Juda-ten inthurualin Paula an beih rawn a, rorêlnaah an hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“He mi hian kan Dân kalh zâwnga Pathian be tûrin mi a thlêm ṭhîn a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Paula chuan chhân a han tum a; mahse, Galiova chuan Juda-te hnênah, “Aw Juda-te u, he thil hi thu chhia emaw, thil sual tih thu emaw ni se, in thu ka lo ngaithla tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, thu leh hmingte leh in Dân chungchânga in buaina thu mai a nih chuan, nangnin ngaihtuah rawh u. Kei zawngin chutiang thil chu ka ngaihtuah duh lo ve,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rorêlna in aṭang chuan a chhuahtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mahse, mi dang zawng zawng chuan sunagog in hotu Sosthena chu an man ta a, rorêlnaah chuan an vua a. Chu pawh chu Galiova chuan engah mah a ngai lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Paula chu ni rei tak a la châm a, chumi hnu chuan unaute chu ṭha takin a ṭhen a. Suria ram lam panin lawngin a chhuak ta a, a rual chuan Priskili leh Akuila te pawh an kal ve a. Paulan thutiam a neih avângin Kenkriai khuaah a lu a mêt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Efesi khua an thleng a, chutah chuan anni chu a hnutchhiah a. Sunagog-a kalin Juda-te chu Pathian thu a chhuipui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anni chuan châm deuh rih tûrin an ngên a; mahse, a remti lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Pathianin rem a tih chuan in hnênah ka lo kal leh dâwn nia,” tiin ṭha takin a ṭhen a, Efesi ata chu lawngin a chhuak leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kaisari a thleng a, Jerusalem-ah a chho ta a, kohhran mite chibai a bûk a, chumi zawh chuan Antiokei-ah a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Rei fe a chawlh hnuin a kal leh a, Galatia ram leh Frugia ram a fang chhuak a, zirtîrho zawng zawngte chu a tinghet zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Juda pakhat, Apolova, Aleksandria khuaa piang chu Efesi khuaah a lo kal a, thu sawi thiam, Pathian thu hre tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa kawng an lo hrilh tawh a, ṭhahnemngai takin Isua chanchin chiang taka sawiin mi a zirtîr ṭhîn a; mahse, Johana baptisma chauh a la hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sunagog-ahte pawh huai takin thu a sawi a, a thu sawi an hriat chuan Priskili leh Akuila chuan an hruai hrang a, Pathian kawng uluk takin an hrilh fiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Akaia rama kal a tum tih an hriat chuan unauten an lo puiha, amah an lo lawm theih nân zirtîrte hnênah lehkha an ziaksak a. A zuk thlen chuan ringtute chu Pathian khawngaihna azârah nasa takin a ṭanpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Vântlâng hriatin Juda-te chu a hnial dang ṭhîn a: Lehkha Thu hmangin Isua chu Krista a nihzia a kawhhmuh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Apolova Korinth-a a awm hlânin Paulan tlângram bial kal tlangin Efesi a lo thleng a, zirtîr ṭhenkhatte a rawn hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An hnênah, “Ringtu in nih tirh khân Thlarau Thianghlim in chang em?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Chang lo, Thlarau Thianghlim a awm tih pawh kan hre hlei nêm!” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chuan, “A nih leh eng baptisma nge in chan le?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Johana baptisma kha,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Paula chuan, “Johana khân sim entîr nân baptisma a chantîr ṭhîn a, a hnunga lo kal tûr Isua chu lo ring tûrin Israel mite a hrilh ṭhîn a nih kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chu chu an hriatin Lalpa Isua hmingin baptisma an chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutia Paulan an chunga kut a nghah lai chuan Thlarau Thianghlim an chungah a lo thleng a, ṭawnghriatlohvin an ṭawng a, Pathian thu te an sawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An vaiin patling sâwm leh pahnih lai an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Paula chu sunagog-ah a inkhâwm ṭhîn a, thla thum lai huai takin thu a sawi a; Pathian ram thu a chhuipui a, hmin a tum hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat erawh chu an khauh hle a, an ring duh lo va. Mipui hmaa kawng thu an sawichhiat tâkah chuan a kalsan a, zirtîrhote chu a hruai hrang a, ni tin, Turana sikulah Pathian thu a chhuipui ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutiang chuan kum hnih lai a ti a; chuvâng chuan, Asia rama mi zawng zawng, Juda-te leh Grik-te chuan Lalpa thu an hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathianin Paula kut hmangin thil mak tam tak a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, a inhrûkna leh a puan sin lai te chu damlote hnênah an keng a, an lo dam ta a, an kawchhûng ata ramhuai bawlhhlawhte pawh an chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, thiam zuara vâk vâk Juda ṭhenkhatten, “Paula hril ṭhin Isua hmingin chhuak tûrin thu kan pe a che,” tiin ramhuai paite chungah Lalpa Isua hming an lam vei ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Juda puithiam lal pakhat Skeva chuan chutiang ti ve ṭhîn fapa pasarih a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ramhuai bawlhhlawh chuan an hnênah, “Isua ka hria, Paula pawh ka hria e; nangni hi tute nge maw in nih le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ramhuai bawlhhlawh pai chuan anni chu a zuan a, an za chuan a hneh ta a; a sawisa a, chu in aṭang chuan saruak leh hliam phungin an tlân chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chu thu chu Efesi mi zawng zawng, Juda-te leh Grik-ten an lo hriat chuan an za-in an hlau va, Lalpa Isua hming chu an chawimawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ringtute zînga tam tak chuan an sual rawn inpuangin an thil lo tih ṭhinte an sawi chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Dawithiam tam tak pawhin an lehkhabute an rawn la khâwm a, mi zawng zawng hmaah an hâl a, a man an chhût a, chêng sîng nga niin an hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuti kauva nasa chuan Lalpa thu chu a darh a, a hneh ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chûng hnuah chuan Paulan Makedonia ram leh Akaia ram fan chhuah zeta, Jerusalem-a kal a rilrûk a. “Chuta ka kal zawhah Rom khua pawh ka tlawh bawk tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Makedonia lamah chuan amah puitu pahnih, Timothea leh Erasta chu a kaltîr a, ani erawh chu Asia ramah chuan a la awm ta rih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Kawng avângin an buai ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Demetria, tangkaraw chher mi, tangkaruaa pathiannu Artemi Tempul lem siamtu chuan mi themthiam tam tak a ruai ṭhîn a, an hlâwk êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Anni chu an thawh ang thawk ve mi dangte nên a ko khâwm a, an hnênah, “Pute u, he hna hi kan sum hnâr a ni tih in hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Efesi-ah chauh hian ni lovin, Asia ram zawng zawng deuhthawah he Paula hian, ‘Kuta siam pathiante chu Pathian an ni lo ve,’ tiin mipui tam tak a hneh a, a hruai kawi zo ta tih nangni ngeiin in hmuin in hre bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, kan hna thawh hi a lân ang tih a hlauhawm chauh a ni lo va, pathian ropui tak Artemi Tempul hi miten an rawn ngainêp ang a, Asia ram pum leh khawvêlin an biak ṭhin hi, a ropui tehlul nên, a tlâwm ang tih a hlauhawm bawk a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chûng thu chu an hriat chuan an thin a rim ta êm êm a, “Efesi-a Artemi hi ropui tak a ni,” tiin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tichuan, a khuain an buai ta a, Gaia leh Aristarka, Makedonia ram mi, Paula zinpuite chu an man a, inthurualin ennawm siamna hmunah an tlânpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Paulan mipui zînga zuan luh ve a tum a; mahse, zirtîrhoten an phal lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Asia ram hotu liante zînga ṭhenkhat chu Paula ṭhiante an ni a, anni pawh chuan mi an rawn tîr a, ennawm siamna hmuna kal ve lo tûrin an rawn ngên bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mipuite lah chu a ṭhen thu khatin an au va, a ṭhen thu dangin an au va, an kal khâwm chu an buai zo ta a, mi tam tak phei chuan an inkhâwm chhan pawh an hre lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Juda-te chuan Aleksandara chu hma lamah an nawr phei avângin mipui zînga ṭhenkhat chuan amah avâng emaw an ti a. Aleksandara chuan ngawi tûrin kutin a han zâp a, mipui hnênah chuan an thiam thu sawi a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chu Juda a ni tih an hriat veleh, dârkâr hnih dâwn lai, “Efesi-a Artemi hi ropui tak a ni,” ti hlîrin an au ta dual dual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khawpui ziaktu chuan mipuite a ngawihtîr hnu chuan, “Efesi mite u, Artemi ropui tak leh a lim thianghlim vân aṭanga lo tla Tempul enkawltu chu Efesi khaw mite hi in nih tu nge hai awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hêng thil hi hnial rual a nih loh ahnu, ngawi ula, thu hnu dâwn lovin eng mah ti suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hêng in mi rawn hruaite hi Tempul rawk hmang an ni lo va, kan pathiannu sawichhetu lah an ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Demetria leh a ṭhianten tu lakah pawh thu pawi an neih chuan thubuai sawina a inhawng reng a, Ramawptute pawh an awm a, an thubuai chu rawn thlen ang hmiang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chu bâk sawi tûr in neih chuan inkhâwm pângngaiah sawi fel tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Vawiin thil hi hel tuma buaina siamah min puh pawh a hlauhthâwnawm alâwm, kan pun khâwm chhan sawi tûr mumal pawh kan hre si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Chûng thu a sawi zawh chuan pungkhâwmte chu a ṭîntîr ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Buai chu a reh hnuin Paulan zirtîrte a ko khâwm a, a fuih a, chibai a bûk a, Makedonia rama kal tûrin a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chu ram chu a fang chhuak a, zirtîrhote chu nasa taka a fuih zawhin Grik ram a thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thla thum a thang hnu chuan Suria ram lama lawnga haw an tum a; nimahsela, Juda-ten thah an tum avângin Makedonia ram tlawh kual zâwnga haw a tum leh ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pura fapa Sopatera, Beroia khaw mi te, Thesalonika khaw mi Aristarka leh Sekunda te, Derbe khaw mi Gaia te, Timothea te, Asia rama mi Tukika te leh Trofima ten an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chûngho chu an kal hmasa a, Troas khuaah min lo nghâk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keini pawh Chhang dawidim telh loh Kût zawhah chuan Filipi khua aṭangin lawngin kan chhuak a, ni nga hnuah Troas kan thleng ve a, chutah chuan ni sarih kan châm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathiannia chhang phel tûra kan inkhâwmin, Paula chuan a tûka kal a tum avângin an hnênah thu a sawi a, zanlai thlengin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In chhâwnga pindan kan inkhâwmnaah chuan khâwnvâr tam tak a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tlangvâl pakhat, Eutuka an tih chu, tukverhah a ṭhu a, Paulan thu a sawi rei tâk êm avângin a mut a chhuak ta hle a, a muthlu a muthlu a; in chhâwng thumna aṭang chuan a tla ta a, thi-in an chhar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Paula chu a tlân thla a, a bawh a, a pawm a, “Thlaphâng teh suh u, a la nung e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An kal chho leh a, chhang an phel a, a ei a, rei tak, khawvâr thleng zakin thukhawchâng a sawipui a; tichuan, a kal chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tlangvâl chu damin in lamah an hruai hâwng a, an thlamuang ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keini chu Asso khaw panin lawngin kan lo kal hmasa a, Paula chuan kea lo kal a tum avângin Asso khuaah lawnga lo chuantîr kan tum a, chu chu ama remruat dân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asso khuaa min rawn fin chuan lawngah a lo chuang ve a, Mitulene khua kan thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan lawngin kan kal leh a, a tûkah Kio thliarkâr zâwn kan thleng a, a tûk lehah Samo thliarkâr kan lût a, a tûk lehah chuan Mileto khua kan thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Paulan Asia rama a awm rei loh nân Efesi chu lawnga kal pelh a tum a, a theih chuan Jerusalem-ah Pentikos Kût hman a tum a, a kal hmanhmawh deuh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mileto aṭang chuan Efesi-ah mi a tîr a, kohhran upate a kohtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An lo thlen chuan an hnênah, “Asia ram ka luh tirh ni aṭangin in hnêna ka awm chhûng zawnga ka awm dân kha in hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Juda-ten mi phiar avânga hrehawm mi delhtu phur chungin, thuhnuairawlh tak leh mittui nên Lalpa rawng ka bâwl ṭhin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />In tâna sâwt tûr chu eng mah zêp lovin, vântlâng zîngah leh inahte ka hrilh ṭhîn che u a, ka zirtîr bawk ṭhin che u kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Juda-te leh Grik-te hnênah pawh, sima Pathian lam hawi tûr leh kan Lalpa Isua ring tûrin urhsûn takin thu ka hril ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tûnah hian hre rawh u; Thlarauvin mi tirh tlat avângin Jerusalem-ah ka kal dâwn a, chutah chuan ka chunga thil lo thleng tûr chin ka hre lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Thlarau Thianghlimin lung in tân leh hrehawm tuar ka hmabâk tih chauh khaw tinah mi hrilh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa Isua hnên ata ka hmuh rawngbâwl hna thawh tûr ka hmabâk, Pathian khawngaihna Chanchin Ṭha puan darh tûr hi ka hlen theih phawt chuan, ka nun pawh hi thlâkhlelh tûrah ka ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tûnah hian hre rawh u, nangni zawng zawng, Pathian ram thu hrila ka vah ka vah ṭhinnate hian ka hmêl in hmu leh tawh lo vang tih ka hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuvângin, mi zawng zawng thisenah ka fihlîm tih vawiin hian ka hriattîr a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathian remruat dân zawng zawng eng mah zêp lovin ka hrilh vek tawh che u kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian kohhran, ama tâna thisena a lei chu châwm tûrin nangmahni leh in berâmte tân fîmkhur rawh u; Thlarau Thianghlimin an chunga hotu-ah a dah che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka kal hnuin chinghne kawlhte in zîngah an lo lût ang a, berâmte chu an zuah lo vang tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nangni zînga mi ngei pawh hi zirtîrhote mahni lama ṭantîr tumin thu hran sawi in la awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chuvângin, invêng ngun rawh u, kum thum meuh a chhûn a zâna mittui nên mi tin ka zilh ṭhin che u kha hre reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tûnah hian Pathian hnênah leh a khawngaihna thu-ah ka hlân a che u; chu chuan a tipuitling thei che u a, mi thianghlimte zîngah rochan a neihtîr thei bawk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tu ma tangka emaw, rangkachak emaw, silhfên emaw ka awh ngai loh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hêng kutte hian keimah leh ka ṭhiante mamawh a thawh chhuah ṭhin kha nangmahni ngeiin in hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chutianga thawkrimin mi chak lote in ṭanpui tûr a ni tih kawng engkimah ka tihhmuh ṭhin che u kha; kan Lalpa ngeiin, ‘Lâk aiin pêk a hlâwk zâwk,’ a tih kha hre reng rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chûng thu a sawi zawh chuan an za-in a ṭhingṭhitpui a, an ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An vaiin an ṭap ta a, Paula nghâwngah an kuah a, an fâwp ngawih ngawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />An lung tichhetu ber chu a hmêl an hmuh leh tawh loh tûr thu a sawi chu a ni. Tichuan, lawng thlengin amah chu an thlah ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kan inthlah fel hnu chuan lawngin kan chhuak a, ngîl takin Kaw thliarkâr kan thleng a, a tûkah Rodo thliarkâr kan thleng a, chuta ṭang chuan Patara khua kan thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Foiniki rama kal tûr lawng pakhat kan hmu a, kan chuang a, kan kal leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kupra thliarkâr kan hmu a, vei lamah kan pêl a. Suria ram panin Tura khua kan thleng a, chutah chuan lawng bungrua thiar chhuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zirtîrhote kan zawng chhuak a, an hnênah ni sarih kan châm a, anni chuan Thlarauvin a hrilh anga Paula chu Jerusalem-a kal lo tûrin an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, chûng zawhah chuan kan chhuak a, kan kal chu zirtîrte chuan an vaiin, an nupui fanaute nên kawtchhuah thlengin min thlah a, tuipui kamah chuan kan ṭhingṭhi a, kan ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chibai kan inbûk a, lawngah kan chuang a, anni chu in lamah an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tura aṭang chuan lawngin Tolemai khua kan thleng a, unaute chibai kan bûk a, an hnênah ni khat kan châm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tûkah kan chhuak leh a, Kaisari khua kan thleng a, Chanchin Ṭha hriltu Filipa inah kan lût a; ani chu upa pasarihte zînga mi kha a ni. A inah kan thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Fanu, nula thianghlim pali a nei a, Pathian thu an hril ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ni rei tak kan châm a, kan châm chhûng chuan Judai ram aṭangin zâwlnei pakhat Agaba a lo chhuk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kan hnênah a lo kal a, Paula kâwnghrên chu a la a, a ke leh a kut a inphuar a, “Jerusalem-a Juda-ten hetiang hian he kâwnghrên neitu hi an phuar ang a, Jentail-te kutah an pe ang, Thlarau Thianghlimin a ti a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chûng thu chu kan hriatin keini leh chu khuaa mite chuan Paula chu Jerusalem-a kal lo tûrin kan ngên chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Paula chuan, “Engtizia nge in ṭah in ṭaha, mi tihlungchhiata mi tihzâm in tum? Lalpa Isua hming avâng chuan Jerusalem-a phuar chang ka huam hlei nêm, thih pawh ka huam asin,” tiin min chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thlêm thlûk rual a nih loh ahnu chuan, ‘Lalpa thu thu ni rawh se,’ kan ti a, kan bâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chûng hnuah chuan kan insiam a, Jerusalem-ah kan chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kaisari khuaa zirtîr ṭhenkhatten min zui a, kan thlenna tûr Nasona inah min hruai a; ani chu Kupra thliarkâra zirtîr hmasate zînga mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jerusalem kan thlen chuan unauten hlim takin min lo lâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Paula hovin Jakoba hnênah kan lêng a. Kohhran upa zawng zawng pawh an lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Paulan anni chu chibai a bûk zawhin a rawngbâwlna hmanga Pathianin Jentail-te zînga thil a tih apiang chu kimchang takin a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Unaute chuan chûng thu chu an hriatin Pathian an fak a. Paula hnênah chuan, “Unaupa, Juda-te zîngah ringtu an tam tâkzia i hmu a, kan Dân ngaina tak vek an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangin Jentail-te zînga Juda awm zawng zawng chu Mosia Dân bânsana, an fate serh tan lo tûr leh Juda-te dân zâwm lo tûrin i zirtîr ṭhîn tih mi sawi an hria a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Engtin nge ni ta ang le? I lo thleng tih an hre ngei dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, i hnênah kan sawi ang hian ti ta che: Thutiam nei lai kan zîngah mipa pali an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chûng mite chu hruai la, an zîngah inthian ve la, lu an meh man tumsak rawh; tichuan, mi zawng zawngin i chanchin an hriat hi dâwt a ni a, nangmah ngei pawh Dân zâwmin Dân ang takin i la awm zêl zâwk a ni tih an hre dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jentail-te zînga ringtute chungchâng thu zawng, milem biakna thil ei lo tûr te, sa thisen ei lo tûr te, sa reh hlum sa ei lo tûr te leh, inngaih bânsan tûra kan thu rêlte kan thawn kha,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, a tûkah Paulan chu mite chu a hruai a, an rual chuan a inthian ve ta a. Tin, Tempulah a lût a, an inthen zawh hun tûr ni leh an hming kima inthawina a hlansak hun tûr ni puithiam a hriattîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ni sarih a tlin dâwn ruaiin Asia rama Juda-ten Paula chu Tempulah an hmu a. Mipui zawng zawng an fuihpawrh a, Paula chu an man ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Israel mite u, min pui rawh u. He mi hi kan chi te, kan Dân te leh he hmun kalh zâwnga ram tina mi zawng zawng zirtîr ṭhîna kha a nih hi, tûnah pawh Tempulah hian Grik mite a luhpui a, he Hmun Thianghlim hi a tibawlhhlawh a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Efesi khaw mi Trofima chu khawpuiah amah nên an hmuh hmasak tawh avângin, Paulan ani chu Tempulah a hruai lût emaw an ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A khuain an buai zo ta a, mipui an lo tlân khâwm tup tup a; Paula chu an man a, Tempul ata an hnûk chhuak a, kawngte an khâr ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ani chu thah an tum lai chuan Jerusalem khaw pum a buai tih sipai hotu lalberin a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ani chu sipaite leh sipai za hotute hruaiin an zîngah a tlân thla a. Mipui chuan sipai hotu lalber leh sipaite chu an hmuh veleh Paula vuak an bâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sipai hotu lalber chuan a rawn hnaih a, Paula chu a man a, khaidiat pahnihin a hlintîr a, tu nge a niha, eng nge a tih a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mipui zînga a ṭhen thu khatin an au va, a ṭhen thu dangin an au bawk si a, buai avâng chuan a eng mah chu a hre chiang thei ta lo va; kulhbîng chhûngah a hruaitîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kailâwn an thlen chuan mipuiin an bawh nasat êm avângin Paula chu sipaiten an chawi kâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mipui tam takin, “Tiboral rawh u,” tia auvin an zui hum hum si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kulhbînga an hruai luh dâwn lai chuan Paulan sipai hotu lalber hnênah, “I hnênah thu kam khat ka sawi thei ang em?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Grik ṭawng i thiam a ni maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chuti chu, Aigupta mi pakhat hmân deuhva helna chawk chhuaka mi thah chîng sângli rual thlalêra hruai chhuaktu kha i ni lo maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Paula chuan, “Kei zawng, Juda mi, Kilikia rama Tarsa khaw mi ka ni, khaw narâna mi ka ni lo; khawngaih takin mipui hnênah hian thu mi sawitîr rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A remtih veleh Paula chu kailâwnah chuan a ding a, mipui chu ngawi tûrin a kutin a zâp a, an ngawi ta ṭhuap a, Hebrai ṭawngin thu a sawi ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Unaute leh pute u, tûna in hnêna ka thiam thu sawi hi ngaithla teh u,” a han ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hebrai ṭawngin thu a sawi tih an hriat chuan an ngawi lehzual a. Ani chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Juda mi, Kilikia rama Tarsa khuaa piang ka ni; nimahsela, he khawpuia sei lian hi ka ni. Gamaliela hnênah min thlahtute Dân khermei taka zawm ka zir a, vawiina nangniho ang bawk hian Pathian tân ṭhahnem ka ngai ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />He kawnga mite hi tihlum hial khawpin ka tiduhdah ṭhîn a, a hmei a pain ka man a, tân inah ka khung ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Puithiam lalber leh upate rorêl ṭhu khâwm pawhin mi hriatpui alâwm. An hnên aṭangin Damaska khuaa unaute pêk tûr lehkha ka la a, chuta awmte chu hrem atân phuar chunga Jerusalem-a rawn hruai tûrin ka kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tichuan, ka kal a, Damaska ka thlen dâwn ruai chuan, chhûn lai tak a ni a, vân aṭangin êng nasa tak mai ka vêlah a lo êng ta phut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leiah ka tlu a, aw ka hria a, aw chuan, ‘Saula, Saula, engah nge mi tihduhdah?’ mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keiin, ‘Lalpa, tu nge i nih?’ ka ti a. Ani chuan ‘Isua, i tihduhdah hi ka ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ṭhiante chuan êng chu an hmu na a, mi betu aw erawh chu an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, keiin, ‘Lalpa, eng nge ka tih ang?’ ka ti a. Lalpa chuan, ‘Tho la, Damaska-ah lût rawh, tah chuan thil engkim i tih tûra ruatte chu an lo hrilh ang che,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu êng ropui avâng chuan khua rêng ka hmu thei ta lo va, ka ṭhianten mi kai a, Damaska-ah kan lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi pakhat, Anania, Dân ang thlapa Pathian be mi, chu khuaa Juda zawng zawngten an fak chu
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ka hnênah a lo kal a, ka kiangah a ding a, ka hnênah, ‘Unau Saul, i mit lo vâr rawh se,’ mi ti a. Chu veleh ka hmu leh thei ta a, amah ka han en a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ani chuan, ‘Min thlahtute Pathianin a duhzâwng hriaa, Mi Feltak chu hmua, a aw ngei hre tûrin a thlang ta a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I thil hmuh leh hriat thu-ah khân mi zawng zawng hnênah thuhretu i ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Muangchâng lovin tho la, a hming lamin baptisma chang la, i sualte tlêng fai rawh,’ mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tin, Jerusalem-a ka haw leha, Tempula ka ṭawngṭai laiin, zêlin ka awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa ka hmu a, ani chuan, ‘Hmanhmawh la, Jerusalem hi chhuahsan rawh; ka chanchin i hril an pawm dâwn lo ve,’ mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keiin, ‘Lalpa, sunagog tina lûta, nangmah ringtute ka vuaka, tân ina ka khung ṭhin kha anmahni ngeiin an hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I thuhretu Stefana thisen an chhuah lai khân, kei pawh an zîngah ka ding a, ka remtihpui a, a thattute puan ka lo vênsak bawk a,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ani chuan ‘Kal rawh, hla takah Jentail-te hnênah ka tîr dâwn che a ni,’ mi ti ta a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chumi a sawi thleng chuan an ngaithla a, ring takin, “Mi hetiang hrep hi khawvêl ata tiboral rawh u, nung tlâk a ni lo ve,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An au va, an puante an hlîp a, vaivut an vawrh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sipai hotu lalber chuan Paula chu kulhbîngah a hruai luhtîr a, a chunga chuti taka an au chhan chu a hmuh chhuah theih nân hruihruala vuaka, dâwp tûrin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vuak tûra savun hruia an phuar zawhin, Paulan a kianga ding sipai za hotu hnênah, “Rom mi, thiam loh chantîr pawh la ni si lo hi vuak a thiang em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sipai za hotu chuan chu thu chu a hriat veleh, sipai hotu lalber hnênah a kal a, “Engtin nge i tih dâwn? He mi hi Rom mi a lo ni reng mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sipai hotu lalber chu a lo kal a, a hnênah, “Rom mi i ni maw? Mi hrilh rawh,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sipai hotu lalber chuan, “Kei chuan Rom mi nihna nei tûrin sum tam tak ka sêng asin,” a ti a. Paula erawh chuan, “Kei zawng Rom mi rênga piang ka ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tichuan, sawisa chunga dâwp tumte chuan Paula chu an ṭînsan ta nghâl a, sipai hotu lalber pawh chuan Rom mi a lo phuar mai tih a han hriatin a hlauthâwng hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Juda-ten Paula chungah thu eng nge an neih hriat chian tumin, sipai hotu lalber chuan puithiam lalte leh Sanhedrin mite inkhâwm tûrin thu a pe a. Paula chu a phelh a, a hruai chhuk a, an hmaah a dintîr a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paula chuan rorêltute chu a han en chiang a, “Unaute u, vawiin thleng hian Pathian hmaa ka awm dânah, ka chhia leh ṭha hriatnaah mahni inthiam lohna eng mah ka nei lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puithiam lalber Anania chuan Paula kianga dingte hnênah, “A ka kha bensak rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Paula chuan, “Nang, bang hnawih vârpa. Pathianin a bêng zâwk ang che. Dân anga mi ngaihtuah tûrin i ṭhu a, dân lo anga mi ben tûr i ti maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kianga dingte chuan, “Puithiam lalber i hau vei maw?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Paula chuan, “Puithiam lalber a ni tih ka hre lo va ni, ‘In hnam rorêltu chungah thu ṭha lo sawi suh,’ tih ziak a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Paulan a ṭhen Sadukai te, a ṭhen Farisai te an ni tih a hria a, Sanhedrin-ah chuan a au va, “Unaute u, kei pawh Farisai ka ni a, Farisai fapa pawh ka ni. Mitthi thawhleh beiseina thu-ah rorêlna hmaah ka ding a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu chu a sawi zawh chuan Farisai-te leh Sadukai-te chu an inhnial a, Sanhedrin mite chu an inṭhen ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sadukai-te chuan, “Thawhlehna rêng a awm lo, vântirhkoh te, thlarau te pawh a awm hek lo,” an ti a. Farisai-te erawh chuan chûng chu an ring si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, an râwl a ring ta hle a, Farisai lama mi Dân zirtîrtu ṭhenkhat an ding a, an ṭang ta tlat a, “He mi chungah hian thil dik lo eng mah kan hmu lo ve, Thlarauvin emaw, vântirhkohvin emaw an bia a ni mahna,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An inhnial nasat deuh deuh avângin, sipai hotu lalber chuan Paula chu an pawh sawm a hlau va, zuk kala, an zîng ata Paula la chhuaka, kulhbînga hruai tûrin sipaite chu thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi zân chuan Lalpa chu Paula kiangah a lo ding a, “Huai takin awm rawh; Jerusalem-a ka thu i hril ang bawk hian, Rom khuaah pawh i hril tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tûk zîngah chuan Juda-te chu Paula phiarin an inkhâwm a, an thah hma chu eng mah eia in lo tûrin chhia an chham a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutianga phiartute chu sawmli aia tam mah an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Puithiam lalte leh upate hnênah an kal a, “Paula kan thah hma chuan eng mah ei lo tûrin chhia kan chham ta vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvângin, tûnah nangni leh rorêltuten a thu chiang lehzuala ngaihtuah tum angin, Paula chu in hnêna hruai thla tûrin sipai hotu lalber hnênah han sawi rawh u; a lo thlen thlâk hmaa that tûrin kan inpeih reng a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, Paula farnua fapain thah tuma an lo chân rûk tûr thu chu a lo hria a, a han kal a, kulhbîng chhûngah a lût a, Paula a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Paula chuan sipai zahotu zînga pakhat a ko va, “He tlangvâl hian sipai hotu lalber hnênah thu eng emaw sawi tûr a nei e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, sipai hotu lalber hnênah chuan a va hruai a, “Mi tâng, Paula khân mi ko va, he tlangvâl hi i hnêna rawn hruai tûrin mi ngên a, i hnênah thu eng emaw sawi tûr a nei a ni âwm e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sipai hotu lalber chuan a kutah a vuan a, a kai hrang a, a rûkin, “Eng nge mi hrilh tûr i neih chu?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Paula thu hi chiang lehzuala ngaihtuah tûr angin naktûkah Sanhedrin hmaa hruai chhuk tûrin Juda-ten dîl che an remti tlâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nimahsela, an thu lo awih suh ang che. An zînga mi sawmli aia tamin an châng reng a, chu mite chuan an thah hma chu eng mah eia in lo tûrin chhia an chham a. Tûnah hian i thu nghâkin inpeih sa-in an awm reng a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sipai hotu lalber chuan tlangvâl chu a kaltîr a, “Hêng thu hi mi hrilh tih tu hnênah mah sawi suh ang che,” a ti tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sipai za hotu pahnih a ko va, “Kaisari-ah zânin dâr kuaa kal tûrin sipai zahnih leh sakawr chungchuang mi sawmsarih leh fei keng mi zahnih buatsaih rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Paula chuanna tûr sakawrte buatsaih bawk ula, him takin Ramawptu Felika hnên in thlen tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hetiang hian lehkha a ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Klaudia Lusian ramawptu zahawm ber Felika chibai a bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />He mi hi Juda-ten an man a, an thah dâwn laiin sipaite hruaiin ka zuk kal a, Rom mi a ni tih ka hriatin ka chhan chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, tihhlum an duh chhan hriat ka duh a, an Sanhedrin hmaah ka hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An Dân engahte emaw hêk a ni tih ka hmu a; nimahsela, thihna khawp meuh emaw, tânna khawp meuh emaw eng mah a tih ka hre thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Juda-ten thah tumin an phiar ru tih miin mi hrilh veleh i hnênah ka rawn tîr ta nghâl a ni: a hêktute pawh a chunga thu pawi an neih apiang i hnêna sawi tûrin ka hriattîr tawh e,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, sipaite chuan thupêk angin a zân a zânin Paula chu an hruai a, Antipatri khua an thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A tûkah chuan sakawr chunga chuang mite chu Paula hruai zêl tûrin an kal a, sipai dangte chuan an kîrsan a, kulhbîng lamah an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Anni chuan Kaisari chu an thleng a, Ramawptu hnênah lehkha chu an pe a, Paula pawh a hmaah an dintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ramawptu chuan a chhiar zawhin, khawi lama mi nge a nih a zâwt a, Kilikia rama mi a ni tih a hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Nangmah hêktute an lo thlen hunah i thu ka ngaihtuah ang,” a ti a; Heroda ina daha vên tûr thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni nga hnuah chuan puithiam lalber Anania leh upa ṭhenkhatte chu ukil pakhat Tertula hruaiin an lo thleng a, Paula chu Ramawptu hmaah an khing ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Paula an koh chhuah hnu chuan Tertula chuan an khinna thu a han sawi ta a: “Felik zahawm ber, nangma zârah thlamuang takin rei tak kan lo awm ta a, i finna avângin he rama mite tân hian thil ṭha lo tak tak te chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kawng tinrêngin hmun tinah siam ṭhat a lo ni ta hi ṭha kan ti a, kan lâwm takmeuh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I tân ninawm ka nih loh nân tawi têin ka han sawi ang e, khawngaih taka min ngaihthlâksak tûrin ka ngên a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />He pa hi mi hnawksak tak, ram tina Juda zawng zawng zînga buaina tichhuaktu, Nazaret pâwl hotu ber a ni tih kan hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tempul pawh tihbawlhhlawh a tum a, kan man ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangmah ngeiin chhâl la, kan hêkna zawng zawng hi a hnên aṭangin i hre chiang thei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Juda-te pawhin a hêkna chu an lo thlâwp a, ‘chutiang chu a ni’ an lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ramawptu chuan thu sawi tûra a han mitmei veleh Paula chuan, “He chite rorêltuah hian kum tam tak i ṭan tawh avângin ngaihṭha takin ka thiam thu ka sawi dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jerusalem-a Pathian be tûra ka han kal chu ni sâwm leh ni hnih lo liam a la ni lo tih i hre thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tempulah emaw, sunagog-ah emaw, khawpui khawi laiah mah mi ka hnial leh buaina siam tûra mi ka fuihpawrh tu man an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tûna an mi hêkna pawh hi a bulbâl i hnêna sawi tûr eng mah an hre hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thil pakhat ka hrilh ang che. ‘Pâwl hrang,’ an tih Kawng thu angin min thlahtute Pathian ka be ṭhîn a, Dân leh zâwlneite Lehkhabu ziak zawng zawng ka ring tho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian ka ring a, mi fel leh fel lote thawhlehna a awm ka ring bawk a; chu chu anmahni ngei pawhin an ring ve si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuvângin, eng lai pawha Pathian leh mihring hmaa sawisêl kai lo, chhia leh ṭha hriatna thiang neih ka tum hrâm hrâm ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Kum tam tak ka thang bo hnuah, ka chipuite chhawmdâwlna pe tûr leh inthawina hlân tûrin Jerusalem-ah ka han kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutianga ka ti lai chu Tempulah mi hmu a; mahse, mipui punkhâwmna a awm lo va, buaina a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asia rama mi Juda ṭhenkhat an awm ve a, chûngte chuan ka chunga thu pawi an neih chuan hetah lo kalin i hmaah mi hêk rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A nih loh leh heta lo kalte hian Sanhedrin hmaa ka din lai khân eng nge ka tihsual an sawi tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />an hmaa ka din laia he thu kam khat, ‘Mitthi thawhlehna thu-ah vawiin hian in hmaah chhâlin ka awm a nih hi,’ ka tih kha a nih nghâl loh chuan,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Felika chuan Kawng thu chu a lo hre hle tawh a, “Sipai hotu lalber Lusia a lo thlen thlâk hunah i thu ka la ngaihtuah ang e,” a ti a, an thu chu a dah ta rih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Paula chu zalên deuhva awmtîra, a ṭhianten a rawng an bâwlsak pawh khap lova vêng tûrin sipai za hotu chu thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, ni eng emaw zât hnuah Felika chu a nupui Drusili, Juda mi hruaiin a lo kal a, Paula chu a kohtîr a, Krista Isua rinna thu a sawi chu a ngaithla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thiam chantîrna thu te, insûm theihna thu te, rorêlna lo awm tûr thu te Paulan a sawi lai chuan Felika chuan hlauhawm a ti hle a, “Kal leh ta rih la, hun remchâng ka neih hunah ka la rawn ko vang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Paulan tangka a pêk a beisei tel bawk a; chuvângin, a ko fo va, a be ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kum hnih a vei hnu chuan Felika chu Porkia Festan a thlâk a. Felika chuan Juda-te tihlâwm a duh a, Paula chu lung inah a hnutchhiah ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Festa chuan ram a awp aṭanga ni thum hnuah chuan Kaisari aṭangin Jerusalem-ah a han kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puithiam lalte leh Juda-te chuan Paula nêna an thubuai chu an lo hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Khawngaih takin Jerusalemah han hruaitîr rawh,” tiin an lo ngên a, kawng laka lo chân rûka thah an tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Festa chuan, “Paula chu Kaisari lung inah a awm reng a, kei pawh ka haw thla thuai dâwn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />sualna a neih chuan in hotuten mi zui thla sela, hêk rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An zîngah chuan ni riat emaw, ni sâwm emaw vêl a châm a. Kaisari-ah a haw thla leh ta a. A tûkah chuan rorêlna ṭhutthlêngah a ṭhu a, Paula chu a hruaitîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A lo thlen chuan Jerusalem aṭanga Juda lo chhukte chu a vêlah an ding a, thu lian fe fe tam takin an hêk a; mahse, an hêknate chu a dik a ni tih an finfiah thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Paula chuan a thiam thu a sawi ve a, “Juda-te Dân ka bawhchhe lo va, Tempul ka tibawlhhlawh lo va, Kaisara pawi eng mah ka sawi hek lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Festa chuan Juda-te lakah tlâktlum a duh a, Paula hnênah chuan, “Jerusalem-a chhohva ka hmaa in thu hi rem i duh em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Paula erawh chuan, “Kaisara rorêlna ṭhutthlêng hmaah ka ding a, hetah ngei hian rêlsak tûr ka ni. Juda-te chungah thil eng mah ka tisual lo tih nangmah ngeiin chiang takin i hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thil sual ka tiha, thihna khawp meuh thil ti ka nih chuan thih ka hnial lo ve. Nimahsela, hêngho mi hêkna hi engmahlo mai a nih si chuan, anni lâwm nân an hnênah tu man mi pe tûr a ni lo. Kan thu hi Kaisara hnêna thlen ka ngên e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Festa chuan a rorêlpuite a biakrâwn hnu chuan, “Kaisara hnêna thlen i duh chuan Kaisara hnênah kal ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ni eng emaw zât a ral hnu chuan Lal Agripa leh Berniki chu Kaisari-ah Festa lâwm tûrin an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ni tam tak an châm a, Festa chuan Paula chungchâng thu chu lal a hrilh a, “Felika khân mi tâng pakhat a hnutchhiah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jerusalem-a ka han kalin Juda Puithiam lalte leh an upaten a thu chu mi lo hrilh a, thiam loh chantîr tûrin mi lo ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei chuan an hnênah, ‘Mi tu mah, amah hêktute nên inhmatawna an inchhâl hmaa thiam loh chantîr mai chu Rom sawrkâr dân a ni lo ve,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hetah an lo chhuk a, muang lovin a tûkah rorêlna ṭhutthlêngah ka ṭhu a, chu mi chu ka kohtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hêktute chu a kiangah an ding a, ka rin ang he huin eng mah thu pawi an sawi ta mang si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anmahni sakhaw thu leh mi pakhat thi tawh, Paulan a nung leha a sawi, Isua chungthu-ah an buai a lo ni lek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keiin chûng thu chu ka ngaihtuah thiam zâwng pawh niin ka hre lo va, Jerusalem-a han kala, an thu chu han rêlsak a duh leh duh loh ka zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nimahsela, Paulan amah ṭha taka vên leh an thu Lalber hnêna thlen a ngên ta zâwk a. Chuvângin, Kaisara hnêna ka tirh theih hma chu vêng ṭha tûrin thu ka pe a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Agripa chuan Festa hnênah, “Kei pawh chu mi thu sawi chu ngaihthlâk ka duh asin,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Naktûkah i ngaithla dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Agripa leh Berniki chu ropui takin an lo kal a, thusawina inah an lût a, sipai hotu liante leh khuaa mi pawimawh deuh deuhte pawh an tel ve a. Festa thupêkin Paula chu an rawn hruai lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Festa chuan, “Lal Agripa leh heta kan zînga awm zawng zawngte u, Juda mipui zawng zawngten ‘Nung tlâk a ni lo ve,’ tia an au va, Jerusalem-ah leh heta a chungchâng thu ka hnêna an sawi chu he mi in hmuha hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, kei chuan thihna khawp meuh eng mah a tih ka hmu lo va, amahin Lalber hnêna thlen a duh avângin tirh ka tum ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Lalber hnêna thlen tûr thu mumal tak eng mah ziak tûr ka hre si lo va; chuvângin, in hmaah ka rawn hruai chhuak a ni; Lal Agrip, i hnêna han hruai bîk deuh ka ni a, chhâl a nih hnua eng emaw ziak tûr ka hriat theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amah an hêkna chiang taka ziak lova lalber hnêna mi tâng tirh chu âwmin ka hre si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Agripa chuan Paula hnênah, “I thiam thu i sawi thei e,” a ti a. Chu veleh Paula chuan a kut a phar a, a thiam thu a sawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Lal Agrip, vawiinah hian i hmaah Juda-te mi hêkna zawng zawnga ka thiam thu ka sawi dâwn avângin vânnei ka inti hle mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda-te khawsak dân leh an inkhin ṭhin dânte i hriat êm avângin vânnei ka inti lehzual a ni. Chuvângin, dawhthei taka ka thu mi ngaihthlâksak tûrin ka ngên a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka tleirâwl tirh aṭang tawhin ka chipuite zîngah leh Jerusalem-a ka awm dân chu a tîr ata Juda-te zawng zawngin an hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An sawi duh chuan hmân aṭanga kan sakhaw pâwl khermei ber Farisai zînga mi ka nih te pawh an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Min thlahtute hnêna a thutiam kha Pathianin a hlen ka beisei thu-ah tûnah hian rorêlna hmaah ka ding a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu thutiam chu hmuh beiseiin kan hnam sâwm leh pahnihte chuan a chhûn a zânin ṭhahnemngai takin rawng an bâwl ṭhîn a ni. Aw, Lal Agrip, chutiang beiseina avâng chuan Juda-te hian mi hêk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Nangni hian engtizia nge Pathianin mitthite a kaihthawh in rin loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei ngei pawhin Nazaret Isua hming kalh zâwnga theihtâwp chhuah tûr niin ka lo inngai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Jerusalem-ah ka ti ṭhîn a, puithiam lalte hnên aṭanga thu lain mi thianghlimte zînga mi tam tak tân inahte ka khung a, tihhlum an tum pawhin ka remtihpui bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sunagog tinah Isua sawichhiattîr tumin ka hrem fo va, an lakah ka kawlh êm êm a, ram dang khaw thleng thlengin ka tiduhdah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Chutiang ti tûr chuan puithiam lalte hnên aṭanga thu hmu leh an thupêk kengin Damaska ka pan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Lal Agrip, kawnga kan kal lai chuan chhûn laiah vân aṭanga êng, ni aia êng ka hmu a, chu chuan kei leh ka kalpuite chu min rawn chhun a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Leiah kan tlu ta vek a, awin Hebrai ṭawngin, ‘Saula, Saula, engati nge mi tihduhdah? Chhunna tiang khen hi i tân a na thlâwn mai mai a ni,’ mi rawn tiin ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Kei chuan, ‘Lalpa, tu nge i nih?’ ka ti a. Lalpa chuan, ‘Isua, i tihduhdah hi ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tho la, i kein ding rawh; ka rawngbâwltu atâna ruat tûr chein i hnênah ka rawn inlâr a ni. Mi hmuh thu leh thil ka la entîr tûr che hi mite i hrilh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Juda-te leh Jentail-te hnênah ka tîr ang che a, an lak ata ka chhan chhuak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei mi rin avânga an sualte ngaihdam an nih theih nân leh, mi thianghlimte zînga rochan an neih ve theihna tûrin. An mit tivârtu tûr te, thim ata eng lama hawi kîrtîr tûr leh Setana thuhnuai ata Pathian lama hawi kîrtîr tûra ruat i ni e,’ mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Chuta ṭang chuan, Lal Agrip, vân inlârna chu ka zâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, Damaska mite hnêna sawi ṭanin, Jerusalem-a mite hnênah te, Judai rama mi zawng zawng leh Jentail-te hnênah sima Pathian lam an hawia, an sim takzet a ni tih a lan nâna thil an tihna tûrin thu ka hril ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan Tempula ka awm laiin Juda-ten mi man a, mi thah an tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathianin mi ṭanpui avângin vawiin thleng pawh hian mi lian leh mi tête hnêna thu hril tûrin ka la ding thei a ni. Zâwlneite leh Mosian thil lo thleng tûr an sawi bâk eng mah ka sawi lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘Krista chuan a tuar ang a, mitthi zîng ata thawh hmahruaitu a ni ang a, Juda-te leh Jentail-te hnênah êng thu a hriattîr ang,’ tia an sawi loh hi chu eng mah dang ka sawi lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutianga thiam thu a sawi lai chuan Festa chu ring takin a au va, “Paula, i â ta a ni e, i zir tam hi i ât phah a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, Paula chuan, “Festa zahawm ber, ka â lo asin; thu dik tak leh thu fing tak ka sawi zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hêng thil hi lal pawhin a hria e, a hnênah pawh huai takin ka sawi hi; a hriat loh pakhat mah a awm lo tih ka hria; hêng thil hi a rûka tih a ni si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lal Agrip, zâwlneite thu i ring em? I ring tih ka hria e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Agripa chuan Paula hnênah, “Rei lo te chhûnga Kristiana mi siam i tum a ni maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Paulan, “Rei se, rei suh se, nang chauh ni lovin, vawiina ka thu ngaithlatute zawng zawng pawh hi keimah anga awm tûrin Pathian hnênah ka dîl a ni, kawl erawh hi chu bun ve lovin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, lal te, Ramawptu te, Berniki te leh an ṭhutpuite chu an tho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />An kal hrang a, an inbia a, “He mi hian thihna khawp emaw, tânna khawp emaw eng mah zawng a tih loh hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Agripa chuan Festa hnênah, “He mi hian Kaisara hnêna thlen dîl lo sela chuan chhuah mai theih a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Itali rama lawnga kal tûra min tih veleh, Paula leh mi tâng dang ṭhenkhatte chu Augasta Sipai pâwl an tiha mi sipai za hotu Julia kutah an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Adramuteno khaw lawng, tuifinriat kama Asia ram khuate tlawh tûrah chuan kan chuang a, kan kal ta a; Makedonia rama Thesalonika khaw mi Aristarka pawh a tel ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Sidon khua kan thleng a, Julia chuan Paula chu a tiṭha hle a, a ṭhiante hnêna lênga a châkkhai lam te a phalsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuta ṭangin lawng chuan kan kal zêl a, thliin a ni lo zâwnga min nem avângin Kupra thliarkâr phên thli ûp lamah kan kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kilikia ram leh Pamfulia ram dep tuipui kan pelh hnuin, Lukia rama Mura khua kan thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutah chuan sipai za hotu chuan Aleksandria khaw lawng, Itali rama kal tûr a hmu a, chu lawngah chuan min chuantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni rei tak zawi zawiin kan kal a, harsa takin Nido khaw zâwn kan thleng hrâm a. A lêt zâwnga thliin min nem avângin Kret thliarkâr phên thli ûp lamah kan kal kual a. Kret thliarkâr hmâwr zum Salmoni an tih chu kan pêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Harsa takin vaukam kan hrût a, hmun pakhat, lawng chawlh hmun Mawi, an tih chu kan thleng a, chu chu Lasai khaw kianga awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ni rei fe kan châm hnu chuan Chawnghei hun a pêl ta bawk a, lawnga kal zêl a hlauhawm hle tawh avângin anni chu Paulan thu a râwn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />an hnênah, “Pute u, tûna kan kal zêl chuan chhiatna nasa tak kan tâwk dâwn tih ka hria; lawng leh a bungraw phurh chauh ni lovin, keini lawnga chuangte tân pawh boral a hlauhawm a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, sipai za hotu chuan Paula thu sawi ai chuan lawngpu leh lawng neitu thu chu a awih ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thlasik tuar nân chu lawng chawlhna chu a remchân loh avângin mi tam zâwkin kal chhuaha, Foiniki khua thlen hrâm a, chuta thlasik tuar chu an duh a. Foiniki khua chu Kret thliarkâra lawng chawlhna pakhat a ni, chhimthlang leh hmârthlang hawi zâwnga awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chhim thli a lo tleh hiau hiau va, an duh ang tak an hmu ta emaw an ti a, thîrchakai chu an khai chhuak a, Kret thliarkâr chu a kam hnaih thei ang berin kan hrût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, rei lo tê-ah khawmual lam aṭangin thlipui na tak a lo tleh chhuk ta phut a, chu thli chu Eurakulo an vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lawng chu a rawn chhêm vir nawk a, thli lam hawia kar her rual ni ta hek lo, a duh duha len tûrin kan awm ta a, min lên min lên ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thliakâr tê tak tê, Kauda an tih phên thli ûp lamah min lên a, harsa tak chungin lawnglêng chu kan hum thei hrâm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lawngah an khai chhuak a, lawng chu hruiin an phuar ta tlat a. Libua kam ṭiaudûpa min len luh an hlauh avângin lawng puanzâr chu an tihniam a; tichuan, min lên min lên leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thli leh tuifâwn chuan min vawrh reng avângin, a tûkah chuan lawng bungraw phurh chu an paih ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni thum ni chuan anmahni kut meuhvin lawng thawmhnaw pawh an paih chhuak leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ni rei tak, ni pawh, arsi pawh a lang lo va, thli lah chuan nasa takin min nuai reng a, dam rêng kan inbeisei tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chaw ei lova ni tam tak an awm hnuin Paula chu an zîngah a ding a, “Pute u, ka thu kha awihin Kret thliarkâr aṭang khân chhuak lo ila chuan hetiang hrehawmna leh hlohnate hi kan tâwk lo tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, tûnah hian thlamuang taka awm tûrin ka ngên a che u. In zîngah tu mah in thi lo vang, lawng erawh hi chu a chhe dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A ta ka ni a, a rawng ka bâwl ṭhin, Pathian chuan vântirhkoh pakhat nizân khân a rawn tîr a, ka kiangah a lo ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘Paula, hlau suh, Kaisara hmaah i ding tûr a ni. Ngai teh, lawnga i zinpuite zawng zawng kha nangmah avângin Pathianin a hum dâwn a ni,’ mi rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuvângin pute u, thlamuang takin awm rawh u. Pathian ka ring a, mi hrilh ang chu a thleng ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thliarkâr khawiah emaw min lên chhuak tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A zan sâwm leh zan li zânah chuan thliin Mediteranean tuipuiah chuan min lên zêl a, zanlai vêlah chuan lawng miten khawmual eng emaw thleng dâwnin an inhria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, tui thûk lam an teh a, hlam sawmhniha thûk a lo ni a, rei lo te hnuah an teh leh a, hlam sâwm leh pangaa thûk a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lung chhe hmuna min len chhuah an hlauh avângin lawng mei lamah chuan thîrchakai pali an thlâk a, khawvâr hlân an nghâkhlel hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lawng mite chuan lawng hnâr lama thîrchakai thlâk tûr ni âwm takin lawnglêng chu tuifinriatah an thlâk a, lawng chu tlânsan an tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chu veleh, Paula chuan sipai za hotu leh sipaite hnênah chuan, “Hêngho hi lawnga an awm reng loh chuan in him thei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tichuan, sipaite chuan lawnglêng hruite chu an zai chat a, an len botîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khawvâr dâwn ṭêpah Paula chuan lawnga mi zawng zawng chu chaw ei tûrin a ngên a, “Vawiin hi eng mah ei lova in awm ni sâwm leh ni lina a lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chuvângin, chaw ei tûrin ka ngên a che u, in nunna tûr a ni e; in zînga tu ma samzai pakhat tê mah a boral lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chûng thu a sawi zawh chuan chhang a la a, an zaa hmaah chuan Pathian hnênah lâwmthu a sawi zawhin a phel a, a ei ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tichuan, an za-in thlamuang takin an ei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lawnga mi chu kan vaiin zahnih leh sawmsarih leh paruk kan ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />An ei kham vek hnu chuan lawng tizâng tûrin an buh phurhte chu tuipuiah an paih chhuak leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Khua a lo vâr chuan khawi lai vaukam nge an thlen an hre lo va, litengsâwla ṭiaupho an hmuhin lawng chu a theih chuan ṭiauphova khalh chhuah an tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Thîrchakai hruite chu an zai chat a, tuipuiah an hnutchhiah ta a; chumi rual chuan a kar herna phuarnate chu an phelh a, hma lam puanzâr chu thli chhêm tûr zâwngin an tisâng a, ṭiaupho chu an pan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Nimahsela, tuizangkhauh pahnih intawhnaah kan lût a, lawng hnâr lam chu a insu bûr ta tlat a, tihchêt rual lohvin a tâng ta a; tuifâwn a nasat êm avângin lawng mei lam pawh chu a keh ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Sipaite chuan tânghote chu thah vek an rawt a, tui hleuh kaite an awm ang a, an tlân bo vang tih an hlau va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nimahsela, sipai za hotu chuan Paula chhanhim a duh a, an thil rawt chu a khap a; tui hleuh thiam apiang chu tuipuia zuang thlaa khawmuala lo kai hmasa tûr leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />mi dang zawng chu thingphel chungah emaw, lawng keh them chungah emaw kai tûrin thu a pe ta a. Chutiang chuan kan za-in khawmualah him takin kan kai ta vek a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kan kai zawh chuan thliarkâr chu Meliti a ni tih kan hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chu thliarkâra mite chuan min lo khawngaih êm êm a. Ruah a sûr avâng leh a vawh êm avângin meipui an chhêm a, kan za-in min lo lâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Paulan thing têl khat a fawm a, meiah a tuah a, a sat avângin rûl a lo chhuak a, a kutah a zem ta tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuta mite chuan a kuta rûl bet reng an hmuh chuan, “He mi hi tualthat a ni phawt mai, tuifinriat aṭangin tlân chhuak mah sela, dik taka Rorêltua chuan a nun a awih tawh lo a nih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chuan rûl chu meiah a thing thla a, engtin mah a awm ta chuang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anni chuan a vûn emaw, thâwklehkhata a tlûka a thih nghâl emaw an ring a. Rei fe an nghâk a, eng mah a ti lo tih an hmuh chuan an rilru an lamlêt a, “Pathian a nih hi,” an ti leh ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi kiang lawkah chuan chumi thliarkâr lal Poplia huan a awm a. Ani chuan min lo lâwm a, ni thum lai lâwm takin min thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Poplia pa chu khawsik leh santên veiin a lo mu reng a. Paula chuan a en a, a luah kut nghatin a ṭawngṭai a, a tidam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan, chu thliarkâra mi dang na nei apiang chu an lo kal a, an dam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anni chuan nasa takin min chawimawi a, kan kal leh dâwn pawh chuan kan mamawh apiang lawngah an lo dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thla thum hnuah chuan lawng pakhat, thlasik laia chu thliarkâra lo châm tawh chuan kan kal leh ta a. Chu lawng chu Diaskuro an vuah a, Aleksandria khaw lawng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Surakus khua kan thleng a, ni thum kan châm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan lawngin kan kal kual a, Regium khua kan thleng a. Ni khat hnuah chhim thli a lo tleh a, a tûk lehah Puteoli khua kan thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutah chuan unaute kan hmu a, an hnêna kâr khat châm tûrin min ngên a, chutiang chuan Rom khua kan thleng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rom khuaa unaute chuan kan chanchin an hriat veleh, ‘Appia Dâwr’ leh ‘Khualbûk Pathum’ thlengin min hmuak tûrin an lo kal a. Paulan chu mite chu a hmuhin Pathian hnênah lâwmthu a sawi a, a thlamuan phah ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rom kan thlen chuan Paula chu sipai vên chunga amaha a awm an phalsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ni thum hnuah chuan Paulan chuta Juda hotute chu a ko khâwm a, an lo kal chuan an hnênah, “Unaute u, kan mite chungah emaw, min thlahtute Dân lakah emaw eng mah ka tisual lo chung pawhin, Jerusalem-ah mi man a, Rom sawrkâr kutah mi hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anni chuan mi chhâl a, thihna khawp meuh eng mah ka tihsual an hmuh loh avângin mi chhuah an tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, Juda-ten an hnial tlat avângin Kaisara hnêna thlen lo thei ka ni ta lo va ni; Mahse, ka chipuite hêk tûra ti ka ni awzâwng lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, hmuh leh biak che u duhin ka ko khâwm che u a ni; Israel-ten an beisei ṭhin, kha mi avâng khân he khaidiat hi ka bun a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Judai ram aṭangin i chanchin sawina lehkha eng mah kan hmu lo va, unaute zînga mi tu mahin i chanchin a chhe lam emaw, a ṭha lam emaw sawi tûr an lo kal hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />He pâwl hi hmun tinah sawichhiat niin kan lo hria a, i ngaih dân pawh hriat kan duh e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, ni an tiam a, chumi ni chuan a awmna inah mi tam takin an rawn pan a, zîng aṭangin zân thlengin Pathian ram thu a sawi a, a hrilh fiah a; Mosia dân bu leh zâwlneite lehkhabu aṭangin Isua chungchâng anmahni awihtîr tumin a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A ṭhenin a thu sawi chu an ring a, a ṭhenin an ring lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An thu a inhmu ta lo va, Paulan thu a sawi zawh chuan an chhuak ta a. A thu sawi chu hei hi a ni: “Thlarau Thianghlimin zâwlnei Isaia kâa in thlahtute hnêna a sawi kha a dik ngawt mai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘He chite hnênah hian kal la, va sawi rawh. In ngaithla in ngaithla ang a, a ngaihna in hre si lo vang. In en in en ang a, in hmu fuh si lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />He mite thinlung hi a lo chawlawl ta a, An bengte an chhu ngawng a, An maimitchhîng bawk a, Chuti ni lo se an mitin an hmu ang a, an bengin an hria ang a, An thinlungin an hre bawk ang a, An hawi kîr leh anga, Anmahni ka lo tidam tûr!’ a tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Pathian chhandamna chu Jentail-te hnênah pêk a ni tih hre rawh u; anni zawngin ngaih pawh an ngaithla ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kum hnih pumhlûm Paula chu ama in luahah chuan a awm a, a hnêna lo lêng apiang a lo lâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian ram thu a hrilh a, Lalpa Isua Krista thu huai takin mi a zirtîr a, tu man an khap lo.
  </para>
</usx>
